2 CONT
2 CONT Presbyterian, Independent Republican, Author. Son of Richard Venable Gaines and Jane Virginia (Watkins) Gaines.
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandson of Richard Jennings Gaines and William Morton Watkins and Martha Watkins Venable and Elizabeth Woodson Venable. President of Eastman College since 1884; President of New York Business Institute; member of many historical,
2 CONC  educational and civic organizations. Received A.B. at Hamton-Sidner College 1875; A.M. 1879; LL.B University of Virginia 1882; graduated Eastman Business College 1882. Married Mrs. M.M. Eastman, of Poughkeepsie, New York, October
2 CONC  29, 1884. She died 1907. 
2 CONT
