2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Morton , Jr. 1736 in Lunenburg County, Virginia, son of Joseph Morton and Elizabeth Davis. He was born 27 DEC 1709 in Prince Edward County, Virginia, and died 28 JUN 1782 in Charlotte County, Virginia.
