2 CONT | sp: Smith BLAKEY of Henrico Co., VA
2 CONT 8) Jane WATKINS (b.Abt 1744)
2 CONT | sp: Charles HUNDLEY
2 CONT 9) Francis WATKINS (Sr.)of Poplar Hill (b.15 Jul 1745-Henrico County,VA d.1826-"Poplar Hill" Prince Edward County,VA)
