2 CONT '''John Alexander Lancaster''' was born on April 12, 1819 in Buckingham, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34708283390 Nathaniel Lancaster] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34756733364 Sarah 
2 CONC Lancaster (Cook)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101389 Frances Venable Leach] circa 1849. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101522 Nathaniel Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34648540672 Sallie Elizabeth Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786742 Richard Venable Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786752 William Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786754 James Leitch Lancaster];
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34710786759 John A. Lancaster]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 28, 1865 in Cumberland, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
