1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Reverend Richard Venable Lancaster was born on 31 August 1888, in Virginia, United States, his father, Nathaniel Lancaster Sr, was 32 and his mother, Annie Fuqua Leitch, was 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lucy Rose Alma Warden on 25 September 1915, in Hardy, West Virginia, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 4 daughters. He lived in Wilkes-Barre, Luzerne, Pennsylvania, United States in 1920 and Fre
2 CONC dericksburg, Rockbridge, Virginia, United States in 1930. He registered for military service in 1919. He died on 23 April 1950, in Hardy, West Virginia, United States, at the age of 61, and was buried in Fredericksburg, Virginia, 
2 CONC United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richard Venable Lancaster''' His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101482 John Alexander Lancaster] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-8101389 Frances Venable Leach]. 
