1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Judith Michaux (Woodson)''' was born in 1707 in Henrico County, Virginia, Colonial America. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-70536983 Richard Woodson] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883394 Anne Woodson (Smith
2 CONC )]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith married [https://www.geni.com/profile-59578012 Jacob Michaux] in 1722 in Henrico County, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-8122699 Elizabeth Venable (Michaux)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-8125938 Capt. Joseph Michaux]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-59993317 Judith Mosby (Michaux)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-8123227 Jacob Michaux, Jr.]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 13, 1744 in Goochland County, Virginia, Colonial America and was buried in Michaux&#39;s Grant Family Cemetery, Michaux, Powhatan County, Virginia, USA. 
2 CONT ----
