2 CONT Mary Woodson was born in 1707 in Henrico County, Virginia, United States 123. She married Richard Truman in September 1739 1. Mary passed away in 1783 in Henrico County, Virginia, United States 123. She was the daughter of Richard
2 CONC  Ferris Woodson and Elizabeth Ann Smith 1. Mary had 10 children with Richard Truman 4.
