1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas2, removed to Cumberland Co., where he  became a man of substantial means and is   known to history as "Thomas Watkins of Swift   Creek." Will dated Mar. 4, 1760, proved June   20, 1760. He is the ancestor of
2 CONC  many noted  Americans. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Property, Children, & Will
2 CONT
2 CONT 1704 Quit Rents of Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Watkins with four land holdings:
2 CONT
2 CONT 200 acres in Henrico County
2 CONT
2 CONT 400 acres in Essex County
2 CONT
2 CONT 190 acres in Norfolk County
2 CONT
2 CONT (Thomas Jr.) 125 acres in King & Queen County
2 CONT
2 CONT Early Virginia Families Along the James River
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Watkins:
2 CONT
2 CONT 400 acs.(N.L.), Henrico Co., on N. side of the main br. of Tuckahoe (Cr.) below the Devil's Wood Yard
2 CONT
2 CONT 16 Aug. 1715, p. 244 (Patent Book #10). 25 Shill. and Imp. of 3 pers: James Mackentush, Francis Hill, Jno. Cook.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buffaloe p22 son Thomas [1714-1783] m Frances Anderson, dau of Henry and Prudence Stratton Anderson. This is Thomas of Swift Creek whose son is known as of Chickamoniny whom Miss Anderson , sister of Claiborne Anderson of Chesterf
2 CONC ield in 1733-from Tearin thro the Wilderness. 
2 CONT
2 CONT p136 also had Susannah = Jooseph Woodson; Mary [1710->1760] m Robert/John Woodson; Elizabeth [1712]
2 CONT
2 CONT Called Thomas "of swift Creek."
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Thomas Watkins (2.HENRY2, 1.Henry1) born abt 1678, Henri co Co., VA, occupation farmer, married ca 1705/10, in Henrico Co., VA, Elizabeth Pride, born abt 1669. Thomas died 4 Mar 1760, Cumberland Co., VA ; of Swift Creek.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis N. Watkins, "A Catalogue of the Descendants of Thomas Watkins of Chickahominy, VA. (N.Y. 1852) Elizabeth: Not positive on name of Elizabeth Pride; birth date from Betty E. Shetter in 1996
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 24. i Susannah Watkins born 1700/1706, Henrico Co., VA, died post 1759, Powhatan Co., Va, married Joseph Woodson.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 25. ii Jane Watkins born 1708.
2 CONT
2 CONT 26. iii Mary Watkins born 1710, Henrico Co., VA, died 13 Feb 1778, Goochland Co., Va, Married Robert Woodson.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 27. iv Elizabeth Watkins born 1712.
2 CONT
2 CONT 28. v Thomas Watkins born 1714, Henrico Co., VA, died Nov 1783, Henrico Co., VA, Married Frances Anderson?.
2 CONT
2 CONT 29. vi Joel Watkins born 1716, Henrico Co., VA, died 27 Jan 177 6, Prince Edward Co., Va, Married Rhoda Gresham.
2 CONT
2 CONT 30. vii Stephen Watkins born 1720, Henrico Co., VA, died 1755, Amelia Co., VA, Married Mary Christian.
2 CONT
2 CONT 31. viii Benjamin Watkins born 1725, Henrico Co., VA, died 12 Feb 1781, Chesterfield Co., Va, Married Elizabeth Cary. 
2 CONT
