2 CONT Anne was baptized on 07 May 1693 Baptism Place	Amsterdam, Noord-Holland, Netherlands Baptism Place (Original)	Oude Waalse Kerk, Amsterdam
2 CONT TWO daughters named Ann (Anne and Annmaddlin). Two named John (Jean and John Paul). Use extreme caution.
