1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Jane Magdalen LeGrand''' was baptized on January 3, 1697 in Amsterdam, Holland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-23956276 Abraham Michaux, II] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-23956328 Susanne Laroche Michaux (Ro
2 CONC chet)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane married [https://www.geni.com/profile-61161664 Jean Pierre LeGrand] in 1724 in Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-80247610 Susannah Miane Cardwell];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-61187302 Abraham LeGrand];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-40579291 Peter LeGrand];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-59993389 John Alexander LeGrand, Sr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-17346136 Alexander , LeGrand, Sr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34654238096 James LeGrand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on July 10, 1737, in Henrico County, Province of Virginia, British Empire. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT I give to my three eldest daughters Anne, '''Jane Magdalin''' and Susanna three hundred Acres of the aforesaid Land to be laid off at the lower end and equally divided between them to have and to hold to them and their heirs forev
