1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Woodson (Michaux)''' was born after 1701 in Holland or England. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-23956276 Abraham Michaux, II] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-23956328 Susanne Laroche Michaux (Rochet)]
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-76073727 Sanbourne Woodson] in June 1728 in Cumberland County, Province of Virginia, Colonial America. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-76070235 Captain Hughes Woodson, Sr]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Historical genealogy of the Woodsons and their connections
2 CONT Fourth generation
2 CONT
