2 CONT Mary Elizabeth Hughes was the niece of Pocahontas through her younger sister Cleopatre (their spelling).
2 CONT Mary Elizabeth Hughes Davis married my 6th Great Grandfather Samuel Burks thus enters the Powhatan Indian blood into my family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Through my 4th Great Grandmother ,Sarah Randolph Burks, The Powhatan blood enters the family again as this Randolph family is descended from Thomas Rolfe, the only child of Pocahontas and John Rolfe.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pocahontas is my 9th Great Aunt on Burks side and Pocahontas is my 9th Great Grandmother on the Randolph side.
2 CONT
2 CONT Pretty cool ancestry for a history teacher :)
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mary Hughes ( Shawano-Chalaka- Powhatan- Xuala- Metis) wife of Nathaniel Davis. Nathaniel also kept her sister - Elizabeth- as a wife. Davis moved to Tennesee with both partners.
