2 CONT Father:  Jacob MICHAUX, s/o Abraham MICHAUX & Suzanne ROCHETTE / ROCHET of France
2 CONT Mother:  Judith WOODSON, d/o Richard WOODSON & Ann SMITH of VA
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT # John VENABLE; m. Elizabeth RAINE, d/o Capt John RAINE; issue: Abraham, Martha, Elizabeth Michaux
2 CONT # Samuel VENABLE; m. Ann ANDERSON, d/o Thomas of Mecklenburg Co., VA; no issue
2 CONT # Abraham VENABLE
2 CONT # Jacob VENABLE; m. Mary VENABLE of Campbell Co., VA; Issue: John Holcombe, Samuel
2 CONT # Nathaniel VENABLE; m. Martha VENABLE d/o Nathaniel VENABLE of Prince Edward Co., VA; issue: Abraham Michaux h/o Catharine HARRIS (issue: Mary Frances, martha Elizabeth, Richard Woodson, Nathaniel Claiborne, Thomas Edmund, Willia
2 CONC m Lewis, Abraham, Benjamin Wilson, Samuel, Ann Virginia), Nathaniel Joseph m1. Elizabeth DENNIS (issue: Bettie Haskins) m2. Mary WOODSON (issue: Nannie W., Martha Agnes, Mary W., Charles W.), Samuel Lewis m. Virginia W. BRANSFORED
2 CONC  (issue: Goodridge Wilson, Nathaniel Benjamin, Thomas S., Elizabeth Mary), Thomas Henry, Elizabeth Mary, Martha Ann Woodson
2 CONT # Josiah VENABLE
2 CONT # Mary VENABLE; m. Charles ALLEN of Hanover Co., VA
2 CONT # Martha VENABLE; m. John HOLCOMBE of Prince Edward Co., VA
2 CONT
