2 CONT Mrs. Bessie Seabury Drewry. DAR ID Number: 35033  Born in Petersburg, Virginia.  Wife of William F. Drewry.  Descendant of Judge Paul Carrington, of Virginia.  Daughter of Peleg S. Seabury and Elizabeth Woodson Watkins, his wife. 
2 CONC  Granddaughter of Samuel V. Watkins and Louisa M. Scott, his wife.  Gr.-granddaughter of William M. Watkins and Elizabeth Venable, his wife.  Gr.-gr.-granddaughter of Samuel Woodson Venable (1756-1821) and Mary Carrington, his wif
2 CONC e.  Gr.-gr.-gr.-granddaughter of Paul Carrington and Margaret Read, his wife.  Paul Carrington, (1733-1818), served in the first House of Delegates and on the Committee of Safety of Charlotte county.  Also Nos. 58, 1775, 2445, 540
2 CONC 5, 8644, 19212, 21838, 23716, 27161, 31152
