1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==changes to be made by a curator==
2 CONT * Place of Birth/Country: (blank)
2 CONT * Place of Death/Country: (blank)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==brief biography and family==
2 CONT Robert Woodson was born about 1634 in Fleur de Hundred, Prince George County, Virginia and died in 1716 in Varina Parish, Henrico County, Virginia. He followed the life of a planter. He acquired both by patent and purchase a comfo
2 CONC rtable estate of land. His name appears frequently in the extant records as witness to various documents. The only public service recorded of him is that of surveyor of highways in Henrico County in 1685. There's no remaining reco
2 CONC rd of his Will or of the administration on his estate.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Dr. John Woodson and Sarah Winston.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1656 in Curles, Henrico County, Virginia, married Elizabeth Ferris (1638-bef 1689), daughter of immigrant Richard Ferris of Curles plantation and his wife Mary Beaple. The Ferris family descended from a Norman family, Henri de 
2 CONC Gascon of Leicestershire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9 children of Elizabeth Ferris and Robert Woodson (5 sons, 4 daughters), all born in Henrico County:
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Woodson, born about 1658, "carpenter" and "merchant"; died before 5 Dec 1715. He married Judith Tarleton.
2 CONT # Robert Woodson born in 1660 and died in Feb 1729/1730. He married, first, Sarah Lewis; second, Rachel Watkins.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Woodson was born in 1662 and died about 1740. She married William Lewis. 
2 CONT # Richard Woodson, born in 1662 and died before 4 Mar 1715/1716. He married Ann [probably Smith].  
2 CONT # Joseph Woodson born about 1664 and died before 15 Oct 1734, of Henrico and Goochland Counties. He married his cousin Jane Woodson (daughter of John Woodson, Jr., son of John Woodson, Sr.).  
2 CONT # Sarah Woodson was born in 1665 and died before 12 Oct 1710. She married Edward Mosby, of Henrico County. (See Mosby Family, ante page 2275.)  
2 CONT # Benjamin Lewis Woodson, of Henrico County, was born on 21 Aug 1666 and died before Aug 1723. He married Sarah Porter.  
2 CONT # Judith Woodson was born about 1673 and died before Jun 1733.  
2 CONT # Mary Woodson was born in 1678 and died on 1 Feb 1766. She married George Payne.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT an alleged 5th great grandfather of Jesse and Frank James
2 CONT
2 CONT ==sources==
2 CONT * ''Tidewater Virginia Families: Chapter 15: The Woodson Family (also Butler Ancestors)''.  Page 404.  < [https://www.ancestry.com/sharing/1463650?mark=ead2541d97608392591306dff17a3b0d5a0d5e043c6464b995b613d04077fac5 AncestryShari
2 CONC ng] > 
