2 CONT !BIRTH: Dorothy Holland, CG, "History and Genealogy of the Christian Family, 1643-1850," p. 4. 'Joseph Woodson was the son of Robert Woodson, born 1634, Prince George County and died about 1707, and his wife, Elizabeth Ferris, the
2 CONC  daughter of Richard Ferris.  Robert Woodson was the son of Dr. John Wson and his wife, Sarah Winston.'
