2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === Life Sketch ===
2 CONT
2 CONT ROBERT WOODSON, 1634, WAS BORN IN FLEUR DE HUNDRED, PRINCE GEORGE CO, VIRGINIA. He was the son of  Dr. John Woodson, 1586 of Devonshire, England. He married Elizabeth Ferris, 1634, in Henrico Co. Virginia in 1656.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ANYONE WORKING ON THE WOODSON FAMILY SHOULD BE KNOWLEDGABLE OF THE BOOK " Historical Genealogy of the Woodsons and Their Connections "
2 CONT
