2 CONT === Person note ===
2 CONT Robert Woodson escaped an Indian Massacre in 1644 when his mother hid him and his brother, John - one under a large washtub and the other in a hole used for storing potatoes during the winter.  For a full account of the event read
2 CONC  pg 7 of THE HOUSE OF GOODE in possession of Karon McGill.
