2 CONT Robert Woodson, Jr. , Deft. vs Benjamin Hatcher Pltf. Trespass. Sd. Deft. on 17th Jany. last past (the same being the Lords day) wth force & arms did enter into one plantacon of the Pltf. in Henrico Parish in this Co. & did enter 
2 CONC the Pltfs. house & take from it one half part of a back (or buck) and the skin, of the value of 40 shill. &c. To the Pltfs. Damage £40: sterl. Jury. Verdict, We find for Pltf. 5 s: damage: Judgt. awarded Pltf. agst. Deft. for sd. 
2 CONC sum of 5 s. to be paid wth costs, also exc. Augt. 2, 1697 . Ibid. p. 153. 
