2 CONT To son Robert, the residue of land in Goochland on Jennytoe Creek..
2 CONT To Son Jonathan, land near White Oak Swamp, between Richard Cocke, Edward Mosby, and Harrison, and his estate to be under the guardianship of my son Stephen until he is 18.
2 CONT To daughter Elizabeth, a negro and items.
2 CONT To daughter Judith; a negro and items.
2 CONT To daughter Agnes, a negro.
2 CONT The rest devided between children Joseph, Robert, Jonathan, and Judith; to be divided by son Stephen and Thomas Watkins...Son Stephen to be executor......
