2 CONT === !MARRIED-PARENTS:William and Mary Quarte ===
2 CONT !MARRIED-PARENTS:William and Mary Quarterly; Vol. 11; p. 54,56 !NOTE: Benjamin was the son of Robert Woodson and Elizabeth Ferris. He married Sarah Porter and had nine children.
