1 NAME Thomas /Morton/
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN Morton
2 _MARNM Morton
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1690
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 FEB 1731
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU Planter
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [According to the article "Morton Family of Henrico, Prince Edward and New Brunswick" published in the Wm and Mary Quarterly in July 1931, Joseph, Thomas and John were all three sons of the John Morton, Sr. who mar
2 CONC ried Joane Hughes, a widow.]
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Morton, born about 1695 Richmond Co., Virginia; died February 1729-30 Henrico Co., Virginia; married Elizabeth Woodson, daughter of Richard Woodson & Ann Smith, 1718 Virginia. Elizabeth was born 1699 & died 20 September 174
2 CONC 0.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 20 Sep 1740, Elizabeth made a deed to her children.  She was the daughter of Richard WOODSON b: 1662 in Curles, Henrico, Virginia & Anne SMITH b: 1677 in , Henrico, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT She Married
2 CONT
2 CONT #1718 in Henrico, Virginia to Thomas, Jr. MORTON (b: BET 1690 AND 1708 in Henrico, Virginia)
2 CONT #before 1725 in Virginia to Edward GOODE Sr. (b: ABT 1700)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas Morton & Elizabeth Woodson
2 CONT
2 CONT #Richard MORTON b: 1721 in , Henrico, Virginia
2 CONT #Thomas MORTON b: ABT 1722 in , Henrico, Virginia
2 CONT #Ann MORTON b: ABT 1725 in , Henrico, Virginia
2 CONT #Judith MORTON b: 1727 in , Charlotte, Virginia married her stepbrother Edward Goode Jr.
2 CONT #John, II MORTON b: 9 Feb 1730 in of Prince Edward, Henrico, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Thomas MORTON:
2 CONT Morton Line goes back to Abrahm Michaux & wife Susanne Rochet, both born in Sudan France. They left
2 CONT France at the time of execution of Huguenots. Went first to Amsterdam, Holland, then to USA. Landed at
2 CONT Jamestown, VA bought land 30 miles from Jamestown.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Children of THOMAS MORTON and ELIZABETH WOODSON are:
2 CONT i.	 	ANN4 MORTON, m. WILLIAM GATHWRIGHT; b. Louisa County, VA.
2 CONT ii.	 	ELIZABETH MORTON.
2 CONT iii.	 	THOMAS MORTON, d. 1802; m. CICILY KATHERIN MOORE.
2 CONT iv.	 	RICHARD MORTON, b. Abt. 1721; d. Aft. 1786; m. JUDITH QUINN, Abt. 1745.
2 CONT More About RICHARD MORTON and JUDITH QUINN:
2 CONT Marriage: Abt. 1745
2 CONT v.	 	JUDITH MORTON, b. 1727, Henrico County, VA; d. Rutherford County, NC; m. EDWARD GOODE; b. 1720, Henrico County, VA; d. 1796, Henrico County, VA.
2 CONT vi.	 	JOHN MORTON, b. 1730, Henrico County, VA; d. 1796, Clinch Mountain, VA; m. MARY ANDERSON, 1750; b. 1736.
2 CONT More About JOHN MORTON and MARY ANDERSON:
2 CONT Marriage: 1750
