2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for JOSEPH MORTON (b. 1753):
2 CONT "The Morton Story" states that Joseph Morton was a Gentleman Justice of Pittsylvania County, Virginia in 1777 and was Captain of a company from that county in the Battle of Guilford Court House, North Carolina.
