1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''''A Patriot of the American Revolution for VIRGINIA with the rank of FIRST LIEUTENANT.  [http://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A079188  DAR Ancestor # A079188]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''''''''''''https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/158433859/archelaus-moon
2 CONT
2 CONT Archelaus  Moon was a son of Jacob Moon.  He was born ca 1756 and Died 1796.  Married twice.
2 CONT 1st to Martha Morton (1758-1784) on 2/11/1778 Charlotte County, VA.  Children located:
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Josiah Pleasant Moon (1779-1833).
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Martha Morton Moon Friend (1782-1855).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd to Ann Anderson on 12/29/1784 Bedford County, VA.  Children located:
2 CONT
2 CONT *    John Anderson Moon (1785-1851).
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Frances Poindexter Moon Nuttall (1786-1820).
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Catherine Anderson Moon Eastin (1791-1843).
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Sarah Anderson Moon Sanders (1793-1853).
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Nancy Dabney Moon Smith (1794-1860).
2 CONT
2 CONT *    Susan Cobb Moon Pilcher (1795-1878).
2 CONT
2 CONT Archelaus Moon died before 7/11/1796 at Fayette County, KY. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/158433859/archelaus-moon
2 CONT * https://ead.lib.virginia.edu/vivaxtf/view?docId=lva/vi01286.xml
