1 OCCU Surgeon
1 TITL Dr. (CSA)
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Info added per DAR's "Lineage Book of the Charter Members" by Mary S Lockwood and published 1895.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Claiborne Goode, was born in Charlotte County, Virginia in 1819 born to Thomas Goode and (son of Mackarness Goode, and Mary Rebecca Barksdale. He was but one of several children unidentified as of 1940.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1842, T.C. Goode married Martha Read, daughter of Dr. Isaac and Panthea (Burwell) Read, born in 1826 in Charlotte County Virginia and died in 1907 at Lynchburg, Virginia. This couple had issue of 10 children. See "The Reads and
2 CONC  Their Relatives" Rouse 1930.
2 CONT
2 CONT T.C. Goode, while attending the wounded, was killed in the Battle of the Wilderness. He was a surgeon in the CSA. (Reference, "The Barksdale Family History and Genealogy" by U.S. Army Captain John Barksdale, 1940
