2 CONT
2 CONT Was a Quaker, a member of the Society of Friends. Quakers came to.
2 CONT
2 CONT Virginia as early as 1657, but in 1660, a law passed to suppress.
2 CONT
2 CONT their activity. In the list of heads of families in Henrico County,.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1679, he is listed in the vicinity of Turkey Island..
