2 CONT from find a grave Birth: 1642 Henrico County Virginia, USADeath: 1703 Henrico County Virginia, USA Rachel Pride married Henry Watkins (was a Quaker) in 1658 in Virginia. Rachel's parents were: John Pride and Elizabeth Holcombe.
