2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Pride was baptized on Dec. 12, 1686 along with his other siblings in Beverly, Massachusetts to John Pride and Jane Lovering.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Pride-121
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Pride (bef. 1686 - 1738)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Joseph Pride===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born before 12 Dec 1686 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Pride and Jane (Lovering) Pride
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Peter Pride, William Pride and Elizabeth (Pride) Conant
2 CONT Husband of Elizabeth (Bond) Pride — married 17 Dec 1702 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Haskell) Pride — married 29 Jun 1721 in Gloucester, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Jane (Pride) Burnham, Amy (Pride) Larrabee, Mary (Pride) Skillings and Sarah (Pride) Stevens
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1738 at about age 51 in Falmouth, Cumberland, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 1 May 2021 | Created 28 Mar 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
