1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daniel family genealogies call him Jacob.  Woodson genealogies call him Benjamin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Elizabeth Watkins, daughter of Thomas Watkins of Swift Creek.  Their children were Thomas, Jacob, and Elizabeth.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel genealogies name the Woodson children Jacob, Joel and Susanna.
2 CONT
2 CONT His widow married William Daniel, son of James, 2nd.
