2 CONT There are no documented sources to validate that the last name of the wife of Thomas Gresham d. 1741 in St. Martin's Parish, Hanover/Spotsylvania was Holcomb.
2 CONT
2 CONT Milt Gresham, a long time Gresham family researcher, states that Mary Holcombe was married to Edward Gresham, and that Barbara Holcombe was married to John Gresham; and their daughter was Rhoda Gresham who married Joseph Rash in A
2 CONC lbemarle, Virginia.
