2 CONT Francis Anderson was the son of Elizabeth Crawforth, who was daughter of Elizabeth Clairorne, who was daughter of William Claiborne III.
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis Anderson of Amelia married Edith Walden on 9 July 1742.  Francis died in 1793.
2 CONT They had children, including:
