1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for NORTH CAROLINA with the rank of Captain.  [http://services.dar.org/public/dar_research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A016885  DAR Ancestor # A016885]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L61Y-RDT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/21548610/micajah-bullock
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Micajah Bullock was born on 20 October 1745, in Hanover Co., Virginia. He was the son of Edward Bullock II ( 1704 VA - 1756 Hanover Co., VA) and Ann Anderson ( 1708 VA - 1753 Hanover Co., VA).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Micajah married twice
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) 21 June 1769, in Granville Co., North Carolina to Frances Pryor ( 1750 NC - 1782 Granville Co., NC).
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of 8 known children.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Susannah Pryor. (1734 VA - 1839 Granville Co., NC) They had 1 known child.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Both wives were daughters of Phillip Pryor and Ann Haden
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 10 March 1827, in Granville Co., North Carolina, at the age of 81, and was buried in Bullocks United Methodist Church Cemetery, Creedmoor, Granville Co., North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT North Carolina
2 CONT Captain
2 CONT Granville Co. Mil.
2 CONT Rev War
