2 CONT Transcription of Tennessee Land Grant No 6294 To all to whom these presents shall come GREETING: KNOW YE, THAT by virtue of part of Certificate No. 689 dated the 12th day of September 1811, issued by the Register of West Tennessee
2 CONC  to William Bradshaw, and entered on the 2nd day of April 1814, by No. 12.464.
