2 CONC of the Clear fork - Beginning at a lynn and dogwood Henry Turneys South East corner running thence West thirty poles to a beech and white walnut, thence South Sixty poles to a Sugartree and buckeye, thence East thirty poles to a l
2 CONC ynn and white walnut, Thence sixty poles to the Beginning.
2 CONT
