1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Jean Pierre LeGrand''' was born on June 2, 1697, in Amsterdam, North-Holland, The Netherlands and was baptized on June 2, 1697, in The Hague, The Hague, South Holland, The Netherlands. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/pro
2 CONC file-59993575 Pierre LeGrand] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-124277599 Judith LeGrand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean married [https://www.geni.com/profile-61161710 Jane Magdalen LeGrand] in 1724 in undefined, VA, United States. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-80247610 Susannah Miane Cardwell];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-61187302 Abraham LeGrand];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-40579291 Peter LeGrand];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-59993389 John Alexander LeGrand, Sr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-17346136 Alexander , LeGrand, Sr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34654238096 James LeGrand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on July 10, 1737, in Goochland, VA, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Jean Pierre Legrand===
2 CONT * born 1695, Amsterdam, Holland 
2 CONT * Christened  	2 Jun 1697  	La Haye, Netherlands 
2 CONT * Died  	10 Jul 1737, Henrico, Virginia 
2 CONT * Family  	Jane Magdalaine Micheaux,   b. 3 Jan 1696/97, Amsterdam, Holland d. 1737, Goochland, 
2 CONT * Married 1724, Henrico, Va  According to "Marriages of Virginia Residents, Vol II, Pt 1, page 143", Peter LeGrand married Jane Maidin Michaux in 1720.
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT *  	1. Peter Legrand, Goochland Co., Virginia d. 11 Jan 1813, Lexington, Fayette, Kentucky 
2 CONT *  	2. Susannah Le Grand,   b. 14 Dec 1721, Goochland Co., Goochland, Va d. 30 May 1813
2 CONT *  	3. John Le Grand,   b. 1725, Henrico, Va d. May 1784, Halifax, Virginia 
2 CONT *  	4. Abraham Le Grand,   b. 1728, Henrico Co., Virginia, Va.   d. 1792, Pittsylvania, Virginia 
2 CONT * 	5. V. Alexander Legrand,   b. 25 Dec 1732, Cumberland, Va, d. 25 Jan 1822, Prince Edward, Virginia 
2 CONT *  	6. James Le Grand,   b. 1734, Henrico, Va d. 1799
2 CONT
