2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Abraham LeGrand's'''  parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-61161664 Jean Pierre &quot;Peter&quot; LeGrand] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-61161710 Jane Magdalen LeGrand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham married [https://www.geni.com/profile-26639586 Agnes Sarah Robinson] . Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568173 Abraham LeGrand, Jr.]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568191 Sally LeGrand]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568192 William T. LeGrand]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568193 Peter LeGrand]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568194 Jesse LeGrand]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568195 Polly LeGrand]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568197 Betsy LeGrand]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568198 George LeGrand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in May 1799 in Pittsylvania Co., VA. 
