1 NOTE {geni:about_me} James LeGrand, who married Elizabeth “Betsy” Wade, daughter of Hampton Wade and
2 CONT Jean Ellis, was a son of Peter LeGrand and Jane Magdalen Michaux. James LeGrand
2 CONT got a bond to marry Betsy Wade on 30 November 1763 in Halifax County, with
2 CONT Hampton Wade as bondsman. James LeGrand was born in Goochland County in 1734
2 CONT and died in North Carolina in 1805. Betsy Wade LeGrand was born in 1742 in Virginia
2 CONT and died there in 1797. (THE WADE REGISTER, Volume 8, Issue 1.)
2 CONT ----
