1 NOTE  Sanburne Woodson was the only child of Joseph and Mary Sanburne
2 CONT Woodson.  Sanburne Woodson's grandmother, Mary Tucker Woodson's will,
2 CONT proved 1 Aug 1710 in Henrico Co,Va, names "my grandson Sanburne, child
2 CONT of my daughter Mary Sanburne, wife of my son Joseph Woodson."
2 CONT
2 CONT When a young man, he went to live in Cumberland County, where he
2 CONT married his second wife, Elizabeeth Hughes, about 1728.  She was the
2 CONT daughter of Stephen Hughes.  After the death of his wife second wife,
2 CONT he married (3) Charity Cheadle.  He died in 1756 at his home in
2 CONT Cumberland County where his will was recorded 28 Jun 1756 and names
2 CONT his wife, Charity, and five chidlren.  The will does  not specify the
2 CONT mother of these children.
