1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anthony Morgan, BIRTH 20 Nov 1686; DEATH 1763 (aged 76–77) Cumberland County, Virginia, USA
2 CONT BURIAL: Burial Details Unknown; MEMORIAL ID 77213875
2 CONT
2 CONT ANTHONY MORGAN was born on 20 November 1686 to Anthony Morgan & Ann Dunkin-Morgan.
2 CONT Anthony married Olive Judi Michaux-Morgan circa 1724 in Virginia, and they had TWO daughters of record:
2 CONT # Elizabeth Michaux Morgan-Minter (1725-1797) &
2 CONT # Agnes Morgan-Clopton (?-1809).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anthony passed away circa 1763 in Cumberland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT REFERENCES:
2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE:
