2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH:
2 CONT 1. Barnes, Mrs. N.W., Evans, Mrs. R.D., 1974, "Abstracts of Wills of Cumberland County, Virginia Will Book I & II, 1749-1792," NSDAR Samuel Sorrell Chapter, Records Committee, p. 47.
2 CONT
2 CONT Book I, p. 267, Inventory of the Estate of Anthony Morgan, Received 25 July 1763, recorded 19 August 1763.
