2 CONT +more
2 CONT
2 CONT ELIZABETH MICHAUX MORGAN-MINTER was born circa 1725 in Virginia to Anthony Morgan & Olive Judy Michaux-Morgan. Elizabeth was the GRANDDAUGHTER of the well known Abraham Michaux & wife Suzanne Rochet-Michaux who escaped persecution
2 CONC  in France for their "Huguenot" Christian Faith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth's Grandmother, Suzanne Rochet, was "The Little Nightcap" who's story of escaping religious persecution in France after the Edict of Nantes was Revoked, is printed in French in Suzanne's own handwriting in the Michaux Fam
2 CONC ily Bible. The Bible is on display at the Library of Union Theological Seminary, Richmond, VA, (the Bible was published in 1659). "The Little Nightcap" story has been reprinted in English several times in historical publications.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married John Oliver Minter, Sr. in 1743 at Cumberland County, Virginia, and they had EIGHT Children that are known of: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anthony Morgan Minter (1747-?),  Phillip Evans Minter (1748-1796),  Elizabeth Minter-Burns (1749-1813),  Joseph Oliver Minter Sr. (1750-1823),  Agnes Minter-Evans (1753-1830),  Judith Minter-Womack (1754-1840),  Jane Minter-Riddle
2 CONC  (1761-1817), &  John Oliver Minter Jr (1762-?).
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth passed away circa 1797 in Chatham County, North Carolina, and was buried in The Minter Family Cemetery on their plantation property located at Haw River Township near the intersection of the Haw & Deep Rivers, in the pro
2 CONC ximity of present day Moncure, Chatham County, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/77123113/elizabeth-michaux-minter
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/77123113/elizabeth-michaux-minter Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Feb 15 2023, 16:23:21 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT Anthony Morgan
2 CONT 1686–1749
2 CONT &
2 CONT Olive Judi Michaux
2 CONT 1706–1760
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: 
2 CONT John Oliver Minter, Sr.
2 CONT 1718–1797 (m. 1743)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT Judith "Judy" Minter Womack
2 CONT 1744–1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Anthony Morgan Minter, Sr.
2 CONT 1747–1807
2 CONT
