1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt Hugh ap Lewis married Margaret DALLATHY, daughter of William DALLATHY and Elizabeth. (Margaret DALLATHY was born about 1645 and died on 28 Nov 1700.)  They were named in his 1677 will along with their children
2 CONC : Elizabeth, Margarett, William, John, & Benjamin.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''This [https://www.geni.com/people/Abadieh-Davis/387950014690003153 Abadieh] is not a daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Lewis/381946979340013407. Abadiah is not listed in Margaret’s fathers 1677 will:
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Will of WILLIAM DALLATHY, GENT. OF BDOS St. Michaels Parish, Barbados 20 Nov 1677, RB6/10, P. 188
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dau Margrett Lewis, wf of Capt. Hugh Lewis;
2 CONT * Wife Elizabeth Dallathy ? Executrx;
2 CONT * gr chn Elizabeth, Margarett, William, John, & Benjamin, all at 18; Capt. John Farmer, Margarett Farmer, Samuell Farmer, & Elizabeth Farmer, the sons & daus of Samuel Farmer Esq of Bdos; James Cowes, gr ch of said Samuel.
2 CONT * Signed William Dallathy.
2 CONT * Wit: John Sparke, William (x) Lukus [or Curtis?], Susannah (x) Barnes
2 CONT * Proved 29 JUNE 1680, court says Hon. John Sparke is also decd.
2 CONT * (Barbados Records Wills and Administrations Volume 1, 2 and 3. Joanne McRee Sanders
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Comments 
2 CONT
2 CONT At least one source records her date of birth as 1653, but given the date of birth of her daughter Elizabeth, that seems unlikely.   - because Elizabeth Lewis is under 12 years old for the birth of her child Elizabeth Venable.Capt
2 CONC . Hugh Lewis is under 12 years old for the birth of his child Elizabeth Venable.
2 CONT
2 CONT William Dallathy married Elizabeth Pelt 25 Oct 1660 in London so Margaret Dallathy was born after date - or her father had an earlier wife. She was named “my daughter Margaret Lewis, wife of Capt Hugh Lewis,” with 5 children, in h
2 CONC is 1677 will.
2 CONT ----
