2 CONT '''This Abadieh is not a daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Capt-Hugh-ap-Lewis/381946617830012308?through=346535323980012266 and https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Lewis/381946979340013407. Abadiah is not listed in "father"
