2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT She is the '''granddaughter''', not daughter, of Nathaniel Davis and Mary Hughes.
2 CONT The notes below explain the missing generations which are explained by the Dear Rush Letter which a copy of its DAR Exhibit Log Picture is in the media section.  The missing generations are explained by the Dear Rush Letter. See t
