2 CONT '''Abadiah Floyd''' was born before 1730 in Accomac, Virginia. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-8560868 Robert Davis] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-8560883 Abadieh Davis (Lewis)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abadiah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-104598614 Col. William Floyd] circa 1746 in Amherst County, Province of Virginia. Together they had the following children:
