2 CONC d, also in his time Native could not own land, or run in public office, most families that were of the mixed race would hide the fact of having the native blood, especially in a time of his when each were at war with each other, J
2 CONC ohn Floyd, owned land , and held public office. He had more to loose than gain for being of the mixed race. 2. He was a very faithful Christian, and Documented as so, telling lies in his time especially wasn't a Christian thing to
