2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Davis (called The Black Davis) who married Abadiah Lewis who was his first wife and had children: Susannah who married David Cox; Martha (sometimes seen as Hannah) married Abraham B. Venable- some books have Martha as the d
2 CONC aughter of Nathaniel Davis and Elizabeth Hughes); Isham(Isom); James married Jane Black; Robert married Jane Jopling; John; Abadiah (Abby) married William Floyd (some books have Abadiah as daughter of Nathaniel Davis and Elizabeth
2 CONC  Hughes); Elizabeth married Unknown Sexton; Nathaniel married Elizabeth Atkins (who is the sister of his stepmother Anna Atkins); Evan married Mary E. Williams.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second wife was Anna Atkins - they had a son Absolom - she may have died in childbirth or shortly thereafter.
2 CONT
2 CONT His third wife was Grace Unknown - they had children Lewis, Landon, and Hugh.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Davis died in Natchez, Georgia which is now Mississippi.I have his will in my notes.
