1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Frances Burks''' was born between 1703 and 1718 in Henrico County, Virginia. 
2 CONT She married William Smith and possibly moved to Franklin County, Virginia. Nothing much is known about her. 
2 CONT It is not known if husband William is related to her sister Mary’s husband Obadiah Smith. 
2 CONT She was not named in her father’s will. 
2 CONT Most sources show her date of birth as 1703 but some web trees put it as late as 1718. 
