1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Mary Ellen Huddleston (Allen)''' was born on March 10, 1777 in Bedford, Bedford County, Virginia, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-87097270 Colonel Charles Allen] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-3
2 CONC 4630442196 Mary Allen (Venable)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married [https://www.geni.com/profile-9079519 Abraham Huddleston] on March 5, 1793 in Bedford Virginia USA, by Nathaniel Shrewsbury. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-9078553 Nancy Thomas (Huddleston)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-70679627 Charles Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-84817002 Mary Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-129875582 Joseph Huddleston, Sr.]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-93263534 John West Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-70680385 Abraham Huddleston, Jr.]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34723901984 Israel Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740746871 Nathan Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740746881 William Huddleston]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34740746878 Marshall Miliner Huddleston]; 
