1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Widow Venable" and "2nd wife of John Woodson"
2 CONT 2 daughters with John Venable. 1 son and 5 daughters with John Woodson.
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Venable Woodson (Raine)''' was born on October 26, 1755 in Goochland County, Virginia. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825692679 Captain John Raine, of Cumberland] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34
2 CONC 703121295 Susannah Raine (Mitchell)]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth first married [https://www.geni.com/profile-36685280 John Venable] in 1775 in Prince Edward, Virginia, British Colonial America. 
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825693105 Elizabeth Venable]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825693106 Martha Ann Venable].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883705 John &quot;Poplar Foot&quot; Woodson, Jr.] after the death of her first husband. John Woodson, Jr , was a patriot and his DAR Ancestor #: A129206 proves she was his 2nd wife
2 CONC  "ELIZABETH RAINE VENABLE" See https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A129206
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34687148509 Nancy C. Ligon (Woodson)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34630518326 Sarah Hatcher Smith (Woodson)]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-38883742 Betsy Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825692687 John Miller Woodson]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34825691603 Susannah Williams (Woodson)].  
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on September 24, 1821 in Goochland County, Virginia, United States. 
2 CONT ----
