1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Richardson White''' was born on October 29, 1773 in Goochland County, Virginia, Colonial America and was baptized on November 18, 1773 in St James Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia, Colonial America. His parents were [
2 CONC https://www.geni.com/profile-34724923435 Richard White] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-34709468492 Lucy White]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richardson married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34724923277 Mary White]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34724856142 Richard White]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34745440123 Delphey Jurney
2 CONC ]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34625904478 Lucy Linney]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34750475296 Achilles White]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 26, 1824 in Iredell County, North Carolina, United States and was buried after March 26, 1824 in Harmony, Iredell County, North Carolina, United States. 
2 CONT ----
