2 CONT Judith Mask was the daughter of John and Elizabeth Mask. She may have been born in St. Peter's Parish where she was baptized on 10 Jul 1698. She married Walter Leake and survived him (per his will dated 31 Oct 1757, probated 16 Ma
2 CONC y 1758 in Goochland Co., VA).
