1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT Not the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Rev-Samuel-Leake/6000000002867139530?through=6000000002867193105 & https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Leake/6000000002867149414?through=6000000002867193105 or of https://www.geni.
2 CONC com/people/John-Leake-I/6000000009395390553?through=6000000002867193105  & https://www.geni.com/people/Judith-Leake/6000000006187412051?through=6000000002867193105
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Leake, daughter of Walter Leake and Judith Mask, was born about 1752, and died 1793/4.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married in 1767 to Nathaniel Ayres, Sr. (1752-16 January 1822).  He was the son of Matthias Ayers and Elizabeth Hales.  His first wife; he married Mary Bondurant second.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT * 1. Judith Ayres † (01 Oct 1768 - 1852/4) + 
2 CONT * 2. John Ayres (22 Jan 1772 - ) 
2 CONT * 3. Samuel Ayres (19 Jul 1774 - ) 
2 CONT * 4. Nathan Ayres, Jr. (19 Dec 1776 - ) 
2 CONT * 5. Walter Ayres (06 Apr 1779 - ) 
2 CONT * 6. Matthias Ayres (31 Aug 1781 - ) 
2 CONT * 7. Elizabeth Ayres (26 Feb 1784 - ) 
2 CONT * 8. Mary Ayres (08 Apr 1786 - ) 
2 CONT * 9. Peter Ayres (04 Feb 1789 - ) 
2 CONT * 10. Jean Ayres (14 May 1791 - ) 
2 CONT * 11. Patsy Ayres (02 Aug 1793 - )
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~nivek/genealogy/individual.html?id=1250
2 CONT
2 CONT [Nathan Ayres] Was a Colonel after the Revolution. Rumored to have been a courier for George Washington (and received a letter from him after the War thanking him for his services) and lost an eye while serving. Also rumored to be
2 CONC  a relative of the famous spy Nathan Hale, but no public genealogies support this. These are taken from "Highland Pioneer Sketches and Family Genealogies" by Elsie Johnson Ayres. Given the lack of evidence and apparent errors, the
2 CONC  stories in the cited book should be taken with a healthy dose of skepticism pending further documentation.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000202627852848&size=large}}
