2 CONT ===  ID: I1443 Name: Sarah Given Name: Sarah Sex: F Death: Bef 16 Jan 1660/61 in Henrico Co., Va. 1 Immigration: Jan 1618/19 Va Note: John Woodson and Sarah came to the colony of Virginia on the ship, "George" in January 1619, the
