2 CONT 2. DR. JOHN2 WOODSON (DR. ALEXANDER1) was born 1586 in Dorsetshire, England, and died April 18, 1644 in Prince George County, VA. He married SARAH WINSTON 1619 in Dorsetshire, England. She was born 1590 in Devonshire, England, and
2 CONC  died January 17, 1659/60 in Prince George County, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for DR. JOHN WOODSON: BIOGRAPHY: John went to school at St. Johns College, Oxford, England and graduated a Doctor in 1604. He became a Surgeon working for Sir George yeardley. Just after their Marriage, John and Sarah came t
2 CONC o America aboard the Ship "George", leaving England on 29 January 1619. John and Sarah accompanied Sir George Yeardley, newly appointed Governor to the Colonies and his Wife.
