2 CONT 466. Nicholas Wyatt 1 was born 2 BETWEEN 1604 AND 1633. He died 3 BETWEEN 1658 AND 1718. Nicholas married 4 Damaris BETWEEN 1630 AND 1673.
2 CONT
2 CONT 467. Damaris 1 was born 2 BETWEEN 1613 AND 1636. She died 3 BETWEEN 1658 AND 1724.
