2 CONT Ships to America - The George, 1619
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------------------------------- ------
2 CONT
2 CONT An alphabetic list of ships to America is provided at Ship Index.
2 CONT A list of more ships to Virginia is provided at Ships & Passengers
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------------------------------- ------
2 CONT
2 CONT The George
2 CONT
2 CONT Voyages are listed at ship name on Ship List
2 CONT
2 CONT 1619 The George, from London, arrived at Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Ship and Passenger Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Passengers from the Port of London on the George to Virginia, 1619:
