2 CONT '''CURLES NECK, HENRICO SHIRE, COLONY OF VIRGINIA'''
2 CONT
2 CONT "This property is among the most significant properties in Henrico County covering almost four centuries in American history". Click < [http://www.henricohistoricalsociety.org/varina.curlesneck.html HERE] > for more from the Henri
2 CONC co County Historical Society. The history of the area goes back to 8000 BC. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000192985203837&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000192984794867&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Thursday, September 26, 2013 CURLES NECK FARM" THE VIRGINIA RESIDENCE of C. K. G. BILLINGS, Esq. ON THE JAMES RIVER'''. < [https://halfpuddinghalfsauce.blogspot.com/2013/09/curles-neck-farm-virginia-residence-of.html link] > 
2 CONT
2 CONT Curles Neck Farm's name is said to derive from the fact that the James River curls around the broad, flat peninsula known as Curles Neck. C. K. G. Billings developed the farm into a horse-breeding farm; however, the farm is better
2 CONC  known for the extensive dairy operations conducted there under A. B. Ruddock. Curies Neck Dairy became the largest dairy farm in the county.
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000192984314847&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ''The riverside is dominated by a monumental portico with Ionic Order columns, brick pediment, and classical entablature.''  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Current day'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 2004 heirs of Frederick Watkins(dairy) put the Curles Neck property on the market for $24 million. < [https://www.washingtontimes.com/news/2004/dec/16/20041216-104603-9593r/ link] >.  It sold in 2006. In 2009, a 156-acre parcel
2 CONC  was sub-divided from the larger property to preserve and protect most of the historic buildings. https://www.facebook.com/CurlsNeckCreekEstuary. The marsh is pockmarked with water-filled depressions because of sand and gravel min
2 CONC ing.  Since then plans for a steel wall to keep flood waters out of the marsh have been approved. Site of the VERY private < [https://www.styleweekly.com/richmond/the-leader-of-a-group-of-prominent-richmond-duck-hunters-gets-winge
2 CONC d-with-an-illegal-baiting-conviction/Content?oid=1385741 Curles Neck Duck Club] >.
2 CONT
2 CONT
