2 CONC h and  Benjamin; also daughters, Sarah, married to Edward Mosby; Elizabeth to William Lewis; Mary to George Payne, and Judith to William Cannon. 
2 CONT # Americans of Gentle Birth Vol I page 358
2 CONT #[https://archive.org/stream/historicalgeneal01wood#page/37/mode/2up HIstorical Genealogy of the Woodsons pp 23-24]
2 CONT # "Greer and Related Familiesof Sanders, Sims, Glenn, Christmas, Smith, Ferris, and Carver Of the Carolinas and Virginia"by Brent Howard Holcomb,1987
2 CONT # https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/a/m/m/Paul-F-Ammons-TX/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-1286.html
2 CONT # https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Family:Richard_Farris_and_Sarah_Hambleton_(1)
2 CONT # https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/ferris/1723/
