1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===John Lewis
2 CONT
2 CONT *Son of	Col. William Lewis, Sr., of Henrico and Elizabeth (Woodson) East
2 CONT *Husband of	Elizabeth (Woodson) Lewis
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John Lewis was referred to in a 1736 Henrico County Deed as "John Lewis of Goochland." According to Genealogy of the Lewis and Kindred Families, John McAllister, 1906, he married a daughter of Jacob Woodson of Goochland County.
2 CONT
