1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/miss-Fleming/6000000026258909222?through=6000000005024311435 who married https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Fleming-the-immigrant/6000000005024311435?through=6000000026258909222
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT ''last updated 15 January 2025''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Judith Tarleton,''' daughter of Stephen Tarleton and Susanna Bates, was born about 1662 at St. Peter's Parish, New Kent County, Virginia, and died before 7 February 1714 Flowerdew Hundred Plantation, Henrico County. In 1712, Ju
2 CONC dith Woodson relinquished her dower rights in land deeded by her husband, John Woodson, merchant, of the parish and county of Henrico. He made his will in 1715, and was dead in 1716
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Woodson, Sr. (bef 1658-bef 5 December 1715), son of Robert Woodson and Elizabeth Ferris, about 1648.  '''She was not the wife of Sir Thomas Fleming.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===The Legend of Sir Thomas Fleming in Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Tarleton-11
2 CONT
2 CONT It was started by R. A. Brock in a column he wrote for the Richmond Standard 7 Feb 1880. Brock's misinformation was debunked as early as 1902 in the William and Mary Quarterly. Unfortunately, the same misinformation continues to b
2 CONC e repeated with no evidence to support it. '''There is no record of a Thomas Fleming in Virginia until several generations later.''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: Sister of John Tarleton, Charles Tarleton, Sarah (Tarleton) Hughes, Susanna (Tarleton) Fleming and Stephen Tarleton II
2 CONT
2 CONT *Susanna Tarleton, Judith's sister, married Charles Fleming.
2 CONT *Two of Judith and John Woodson's children, Tarleton and John Jr. married daughters of Charles and Susanna Fleming:
2 CONT **     Tarleton Woodson married Ursula Fleming.  
2 CONT **     John Woodson Jr. married Susannah (Fleming) Bates.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Woodson and Judith Tarleton:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Robert Woodson b. c. 1689, married Sarah Womack
2 CONT # Tarleton Woodson b. 1690 married his cousin Ursula Fleming (daughter of Charles Fleming & Susanna Tarleton)
2 CONT # ? Sarah (Woodson) Sharp 1691-1772 
2 CONT #Josiah Woodson  1702-1736 
2 CONT # John Woodson, Jr. b. 1695 married his cousin Susannah (Fleming) Bates (daughter of Charles Fleming & Susanna Tarleton)
2 CONT # ? Richard Woodson b. 1698
2 CONT # Jacob Woodson 1699-1728 
2 CONT #Stephen Woodson Sr 1704-1735 married Elizabeth Branch
2 CONT #Judith Woodson 1706-1774 married Stephen Cox 
2 CONT #Elizabeth Woodson b. 1708 married "John Pleasants, of Pickanockie."
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Tarleton-11 WikiTree Genealogy] via sister [http://www.geni.com/profile-52237556 Susanna Fleming (born Tarleton)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 23 2
2 CONC 015, 17:55:47 UTC''
2 CONT * http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/TARLETON/2010-06/1275426268
