1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Woodson was the son of John Woodson and Judith Tarleton Woodson. He was born in Henrico County, and was probably confused many times with his father and his cousins. John married Susanna Fleming Bates, the wid
2 CONC ow of John Bates, Jr. and the sister of Ursula Fleming. They were married after 1723. for John Bates died that year. Susanna and John Bates had children, but Susanna and John Woodson did not have any children.
2 CONT
2 CONT —————
