2 CONT
2 CONT Henrico, Virginia wills & deeds 1714-1718, pages 81-85.
2 CONT This inventory and appraisal of the estate of John Woodson, deceased, taken on 23 April 1716 by Richard Cocke Jr, Thomas Randolph and John Archer, includes the following enslaved individuals:
2 CONT *Dick, a man (page 81)
2 CONT *Winter, a man (page 81)
2 CONT *Old Dick (page 84)
2 CONT *Bess, a girl about 14 years of age (page 84)
2 CONT *Judith, a girl (page 84).
2 CONT The the end of the document:  "Tarlton Woodson, being a Quaker, presented this inventory upon his solemn affirmation".  
2 CONT
