1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT October 5, 1757 . Robert Mosby, Sr. , in consideration of his marriage with Agnes Pulliam of Hanover County agrees to lend her for her natural life (in case she should outlive the said Mosby after his marriage to her) 2 negroes, G
2 CONC race and Peter , one feather bed, 5 head of cattle, 6 sheep, 10 hogs, "and the liberty of the small room during her natural life." And the said Agnes agrees not to lay any further claim to the said Robert 's estate. This agreement
2 CONC  is made in the penal sum of œ500. Ibid., p. 517. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Oct. 10, 1757 . Robert Mosby the Elder to Robert Mosby , his son, tract whereon he now lives in Henrico containing 560 acres-after the death of the said Robert Mosby the Elder. Ibid., p. 519. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Oct. 5, 1747 . Robert Mosby of parish and county of Henrico to David Whitlock for œ16; 200 acres in Henrico south side Chickahominy Swamp on the north side the branch called Long and Hungary Thomas Pleasants being part of a tract 
2 CONC of land which was granted by patent to John Watson dated the 22d day of February, 1724 , and by the said Watson was transferred to the aforesaid Robert Mosby as by his need dated the 6th day of June, 1726 . D. B. 1744-8 , p. 318. 
2 CONT
2 CONT March, 1759 . An inventory and appraisement of the estate of Robert Moseby , decd., is presented in court and recorded. Ibid., p. 318. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dec., 1761 . Robert Moseby appointed guardian to Wm. Mosby , orphan of Robert Mosby , and gives bond according to law. Ibid., p. 539. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Aug., 1764 . Wm. Mosby by Robert Mosby his guardian vs. Mary Clarke , Betty Ann Mosby , and Josiah Mosby orphans of Robert Mosby , decd. (in chancery). Ibid., p. 313. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sept., 1764 . Robert Mosby , guardian of Wm. Mosby produced an account of his ward's estate, and Isaac Winston et al. Gent. are ordered to examine said report and return account to next court. Ibid., p. 335. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Aug. 4, 1766 . The sheriff is instructed to summon Robert Mosby to render account of his wards estate, he having failed so to do. Ibid., p. 614. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sept., 1766 . Robt. Mosby returned an account of Wm. Mosby , his ward's estate, which is ordered to be recorded. Ibid., p. 683. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dec., 1766 . Betty Ann Mosby , orphan of Robert Mosby decd. Chooses Robert Mosby as her guardian and he acknowledges bond with Danl. Price , Security, which is recorded. Said Robert Mosby is also appointed guardian of Josiah Mosby
2 CONC  , orphan of Robert Mosby , decd., and said Robert acknowledged bond Danl. Price , Security, which is recorded. Ibid., p. 643. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Aug., 1767 . Robert Mosby ordered to be summoned by the sheriff to appear at next court to render an account of his ward's estate. O. B. 1767-69 , p. 95. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
