2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. James Daniel (b. 1700, d. Aft. 1761) Capt. James Daniel (son of James Daniel and Anne Parker) was born 1700 in Henrico Co., VA, and died Aft. 1761 in Albemarle, VA. He married Elizabeth Woodson on 1721 in Virginia, daughter 
2 CONC of Benjamin Woodson and Sarah Porter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Capt. James Daniel: This James Daniel/Daniell may have been born in Hancock County, Georgia. More About Capt. James Daniel and Elizabeth Woodson: Marriage: 1721, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Capt. James Daniel and Elizabeth Woodson:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Benjamin Woodson Daniel, b. 1736, Virginia, d. September 1791, Wake Co., North Carolina. 
2 CONT *lt. James Daniel, b. 1730, d. 1789, Halifax Co., Virginia. 
2 CONT *Mary Daniel, b. 1749, d. date unknow
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT BENJAMIN Woodson  (son of first Robert) married Sarah Porter, and left issue, sons, WILLIAM, BENJAMIN, JOSEPH, JOHN and ROBERT, and daughters, ELIZABETH, married to James Daniel, and SARAH, to John Allen.
2 CONT
