1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1.	Elizabeth Cannon was born 1681 in Henrico County, Virginia, and died APR 1792 in Henrico County, Virginia. She was the daughter of 2. William Cannon and 3. Judith Woodson.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Abraham Childers 1701 in Henrico County, Virginia, son of Abraham Childers and Anne Pugh. He was born 1679 in Henrico County, Virginia, and died Bef 12 APR 1764 in Albemarle County, Virginia.  	 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Children of Elizabeth Cannon and Abraham Childers are:
2 CONT * 1.	  i.	Abraham Childers was born 1702 in Henrico County, Virginia, and died 22 DEC 1763 in Albemarle County, Virginia. He married Lucy Thomas 1752 in Virginia. She was born Aft 1696 in Albemarle County, Virginia, and died 26 JA
2 CONC N 1792 in Amherst County, Virginia.
2 CONT *  	  ii.	Elizabeth Childers was born 1714 in Henrico County, Virginia, and died 1758 in Henrico County, Virginia. She married James Thomas 13 JUL 1753 in Albermarle County, Virginia. He was born 1702 in Campbell County, Virginia,
2 CONC  and died 25 MAY 1801 in Cumberland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=stevensp&id=I02349
2 CONT
