2 CONT * Abraham Childers IV (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III).
2 CONT * Ioniah Childers (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III). She married Samuel Taylor.
2 CONT * Tabitha Childers (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III). She married Dawson.
2 CONT * Lucretia Childers (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III), died Bef. 1787. She married Tucker.
2 CONT * Elizabeth Childers (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III). She married James Thomason (Source: "The Virginia Genealogists," vol. 34 page 107.) 13 July 1753 (Source: "The Virginia Genealogists," vol. 34 page 107.).
2 CONT * Mary Ann Childers (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III). She married ? Carter (Source: "The Virginia Genealogists," vol. 34 page 108.).
2 CONT * Willam Cannon Childers (Source: Will of Abraham Childers, III), born Abt. 1718 (Source: "The Virginia Genealogists," vol. 34 page 103.); died Aft. 1765.
2 CONT * Creed Childers (Source: "The Virginia Genealogists," vol. 34 page 101.), born Abt. 1746 (Source: "The Virginia Genealogists," vol. 34 page 108.)
2 CONT
