1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT When Benjamin Cannon was born in 1709, in Henrico, Virginia, United States, his father, William I Cannon, was 34 and his mother, Judith Woodson, was 36. He married Susannah Walters before 1731, in Henrico, Virginia, British Coloni
2 CONC al America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 3 daughters. He died in 1756, in Cumberland, Virginia, British Colonial America, at the age of 47.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
