1 NAME Simcock /Cannon/
2 GIVN Simcock
2 SURN Cannon
2 _MARNM Cannon
2 NICK Simon
2 NICK Simeon
2 NICK Kennon
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1720
