1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Burial=
2 CONT Buried in an unmarked grave in Payne Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1670 Virginia, USA Death: 	Jan. 15, 1744 Goochland Goochland County Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary Woodson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Mary Jane Woodson Payne (1678 - 1766)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Josias Payne (1705 - 1785)*
2 CONT   George Payne (1707 - 1784)*
2 CONT   Robert Payne (1709 - 1739)*
2 CONT   John Payne (1713 - 1784)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Payne Cemetery  Goochland Goochland County Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Edit Virtual Cemetery info [?]
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Anonymous Record added: Jul 05, 2005  Find A Grave Memorial# 11294367 [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GScid=51607&GRid=11294367& Find A Grave Memorial# 11294367]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note''': His FindAGrave memorial and many family web sites give 1695 as his birth birth year, but that could not possibly be correct.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Notes=
2 CONT George Payne, son of William Payne and Susannah Merriman, was born about 1695 in Sittingbourne, Rappahanock Co., VA. He married Mary Woodson on 30 Oct 1704 in Goochland Co., VA. George signed a will on 3 Dec 1744 in Goochland Co.,
2 CONC  VA. George died before 15 Jan 1745 in Goochland Co., VA., when his will was probated.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was Justice in Goochland Co. 1728-1729 and sheriff, 1734-1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.familysearch.org/eng/search/AF/individual_record.asp?recid=12214823&lds=0&frompage=99
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Genealogy of George==
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.juch.org/woodson/pafg03.asp#22947 Some Descendants of "Dr." John Woodson]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note''': Some bad info on the Woodson page.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Descendants==
2 CONT George and Mary (Woodson) Payne were the great-grandparents of First Lady Dolly Payne Madison.
2 CONT --------------------
