2 CONC rom 1752 to 1768 inclusive, lieutenant-colonel of militia and member of the Revolutionary Committee of Safety of Goochland. John Payne married, 1st, Miss Archer.</p>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary Woodson.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11294367/george-john-payne Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 21 2022, 16:58:43 UTC''
2 CONT
