2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT "From the frequent intermarriages of members of the Payne family of Goochland county, with families resident in the Northern Neck (such marriages very seldom taking place in other Goochland families), it would seem very probable t
2 CONC hat George Payne came from that section of Virginia. It seems very likely that he was the 'brother George Payne' named in the wills of Richard Payne of Lancaster county, 1709; and of William Payne of Lancaster 1726. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They were sons of William Payne and wife Susannah Merriman, daughter of Richard Merriman, Gent., of Lancaster." (Va. Hist. Mag., Vol. VI., p. 314, Jan. 1899.)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT 1. Josias Payne,   b. 30 Oct 1705, Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia   d. 17 Dec 1785, Pittsylvania County, Virginia 
2 CONT 2. George Payne,   b. 21 Nov 1707, Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia   d. 15 Mar 1784, Goochland County, Virginia 
2 CONT 3. Robert Payne,   b. 16 Nov 1709, Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia   d. 1739, Goochland County, Virginia 
2 CONT 4. John Payne,   b. 4 Dec 1713, Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia   d. 17 Aug 1784, Goochland County, Virginia
2 CONT
