2 CONT =Bio=
2 CONT
2 CONT May have been born in Northam, Goochland County, Virginia instead of Goochland. Married Anne Flemming in 1732 and they purchased a farm in Goochland County the same year, Virginia. Member of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List
2 CONC _of_members_of_the_Virginia_House_of_Burgesses Virginia House of Burgess] in 1761 and 1765, from Goochland County, Virginia.
2 CONT
