2 CONT
2 CONT =Burial=
2 CONT Buried in an unmarked grave in Payne Cemetery.  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11294344/josias-payne
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Northam, Goochland County, Virginia. A son of George and Mary Jane Woodson Payne. He purchased a farm with wife Anne in 1732 in Goochland County, Virginia. He was a member of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_
2 CONC of_members_of_the_Virginia_House_of_Burgesses Virginia House of Burgess] in 1761 and 1765, from Goochland County, Virginia. He was married to Anna Flemming in 1732 in Goochland County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
