2 CONC 1.5em 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 'Open Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Will proved December 19, 1785 in Pittsylvania County Court</p>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in Northam, Goochland County, Virginia. A son of George and Mary Jane Woodson Payne. He purchased a farm with wife Anne in 1732 in Goochland County, Virginia.He was a member of the Virginia House of Burgess in 1761 and
2 CONC  1765, from Goochland County, Virginia. He was married to Anna Flemming in 1732 in Goochland County, Virginia.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/11294344/josias-payne Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/p
2 CONC rojects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 21 2022, 16:56:58 UTC''
