1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT Hannah Daft was born in 1644 in England.  She was [not] the daughter of William Daft (1606–1648) and Joan / Johanna Parker (1612–1672). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah married John Smith (1638–1691) 11 Feb 1676, in Henrico County, Virginia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Smith passed away after 1680 in Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Luke Smith Was born in 1710 and died before 1783. His father was Obadiah Smith, son of John Smith who wrote his will in 1689 in Charles City County Virginia. John Smith and Hannah Daft had two sons: Obadiah, and Luke who married A
2 CONC rabella GROMARRIN.
2 CONT
