2 CONT *“Genealogy of the Cocke Family of Virginia.” The Virginia Magazine of History and Biography, vol. 4, no. 1, 1896, pp. 86–96, http://www.jstor.org/stable/4241941. Accessed 16 Apr. 2022.
2 CONT
