1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Charles Morton''' was born on June 19, 1752 in Pamplin, Appomattox County, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-52745619 Capt. John Morton] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-16828644293 Mary E
2 CONC lizabeth Anderson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles married [https://www.geni.com/profile-61816293 Mary Catherine Morton]. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34658536710 John Morton]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34668946661 Nathaniel Morton]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34668946703 William Morton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died circa 1787 in Charlotte County, VA, United States. 
2 CONT ----
