1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Nancy Hix (Woodson)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/83651106/nancy-hix Find A Grave Memorial ID # 83651106] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Dr. Archibald Hix on 16 February 1797 in Prince Edward County, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT From a Sons of the American Revolution application, Archibald's birth date is 1 March 1770 and death date is 24 August 1839. The 1830 census has him living with his family in Chariton County, Missouri. His burial location is undet
2 CONC ermined as of May 2022 but likely in Douglas Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Notice the Brunswicker October 14, 1847
2 CONT Died of consumption at her residence in Bowling Green prairie, in this county on the 8th ins in her 86th year, Mrs. Nancy Hix, relict of the late Dr. Archibald Hix and daughter of the late Jacob and Elizabeth Woodson of Prince Edw
2 CONC ard County, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contributor: Sharon Wilkey (48871448) • charitoncountymuseum@gmail.com
