1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Richard Woodson'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Woodson
2 CONT born 21 September 1787, died 3 July 1822
2 CONT Father: Jacob Woodson (born 11 May 1748, died 5 December 1839)
2 CONT Mother: Elizabeth Morton (born 28 November 1754, died 12 February 1845)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family:
2 CONT * Rachel P. Robertson (born 1792, died 1847)
2 CONT * William Cowper Woodson+ (born 14 February 1813, died 25 May 1890)
2 CONT * James Woodson (born about 1814)
2 CONT * Elizabeth Morton Woodson (born 29 April 1815, died 1895)
2 CONT * Martha Woodson (born about 1819)
2 CONT * Richard Woodson, Jr.+ (born 24 November 1822, died 17 April 1891)
2 CONT
2 CONT Facts and Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Chariton County, Missouri
2 CONT Religious Affiliation: Methodist1
2 CONT Birth: 21 September 1787; Prince Edward County, Virginia
2 CONT Marriage: 16 April 1812; Rachel P. Robertson6
2 CONT Marriage: 2 May 1812; Rachel P. Robertson; Campbell County, Virginia
2 CONT Marriage: 16 May 1812; Rachel P. Robertson7,2
2 CONT Arrival: 1817; Missouri; he was one of the first American settlers of the state and made the journey west from Virginia by the wagon road through the wilderness7
2 CONT Anecdote: Between 1817 and 1822; He was a man of sturdy character, and contributed largely to the development of social, religious, and interests in the new state of Missouri7
2 CONT Occupation: Before 1822; Farmer, Civil Engineer1,2,7
2 CONT Death: 3 July 1822; Chariton County, Missouri; He died at his home
2 CONT Related Pages: Ancestors of Marianna Woodson; Descendants of John Woodson (#1); Descendants of John Woodson (#2)
2 CONT
