2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/64072900/elizabeth-morton-lewis Find A Grave Memorial ID # 64072900]  
2 CONT
2 CONT Judge Henry B. Lewis and Elizabeth Morton Lewis (Woodson) moved to Glasgow, Howard County, Missouri from Prince Edward County, Virginia in 1817, along with Elizabeth Morton Lewis (Woodson) parents. Henry Lewis, a judge, settled on
2 CONC  a farm called 'Hackleberry Grove', and became active in the educational and cultural institutions.
2 CONT
2 CONT FYI - I've submitted an Find A Grave edit to have her birthdate corrected, then I can link her to the children already connected to Judge Lewis)
