2 CONT Find A Grave<br/>
2 CONT Memorial ID: #50052087<br/>
2 CONT <br/>This needs to be curated for accuracy. There are so many John Mortons in Virginia at this time. The profile I have marked on Find A Grave is totally wrong. There is a curated DAR profile for Capt. John Morton on Geni. I for o
2 CONC ne want to know the correct John Morton. ...more importantly, I want to know if any Morton had anything to do with getting to John Robert Dyer Sr. or Jr. of whom I know are my relatives.  --Robert Jeffers
