1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary was the youngest daughter of Capt. John Cowan a Revolutionary War vet & early pioneer in Kentucky. She became the wife of Dr. Joseph Morton Venable & moved with him to several towns in Missouri and Indiana. In
2 CONC  what is now La Fayette Township, Mary became a founder of Old School Presbyterian Church. Her husband died in South Hanover, IN in 1838. (bio information provided by descendant Jean R. Meaney Wheatly)
