1 NAME James /Logan/
2 GIVN James
2 SURN Logan
2 _MARNM Logan
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC New Monmouth Presbyterian Church Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 STAE VA
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1733
2 ADDR
3 STAE County Armagh
3 CTRY N. Ireland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 19 JUN 1825
2 ADDR
3 STAE VA
3 CTRY United States
1 TITL Captain
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/31232526/james-logan
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Hannah Erwin/Irwin abt 1765.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of James and Hannah: Anna Logan  John Logan Robert Logan Alexander Logan Margaret Logan Elizabeth Logan James Logan Mary Logan Joseph Davies Logan Irwin Logan William Logan Benjamin Alexander Logan
2 CONT
2 CONT 12/27/2011- According to the book, "The Irwins, Doaks, Logans and McCampbells of Virginia and Kentucky" by Margaret Logan Morris, pub. 1916, p. 48, both James and Hannah Logan "are buried at New Monmouth church cemetery, Rockbridg
2 CONC e County, Va."
2 CONT
2 CONT However, it has been brought to my attention by another James Logan descendant that New Monmouth church was not yet built when James died, but that it's possible he was buried at Old Monmouth church cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT I would love to hear from anyone who has proof of James' and Hannah's burial place.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT James Hervey Logan
2 CONT
