2 CONT Supplement to the Curd Family in America  (GenealogyLibrary.com)
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry, Jr.2, d. in Henrico, 1714-15, leaving a wife, Mary (possibly Mary Crispe), and sons John, Benjamin, Joseph, Henry and Stephen. Will dated Nov. 15, 1714, proved Feb. 1714/15.  Mary, his widow, m. (2) Edward Mosby. 
