2 CONC t., Garden City, Kansas, 67846; (Vol. I, © 1979 Gateway Press, Inc., Baltimore; Vol. II, © 1992 Privately Published by Rita Hineman Townsend); Vol. 1, pgs. 1-14; Vol. 2, pgs. 1-6; contains the following: Elmore Hutchins of My Lady
