2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT [[Category:Henrico County, Virginia Colony]][[Category:Goochland County, Virginia Colony]]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==Joseph Watkins, son of Henry Watkins and Mary Crisp,≤ref>from the profile for [[Watkins-311|Joseph's father]]:≤br>: Will records show that Henry Watkin's wife Mary was named "to be Executrix" on a document dated Nov
2 CONC ember 15, 1714, and recorded February 7, 1715, which named his sons: John, Benjamin, Joseph, Henry & Stephen.*COLONIAL WILLS OF HENRICO CO VA 1654-1731, Benjamin B. Weisiger III, 1976; Wills & Deeds 1714-1718; p.10:* Will of Henry
2 CONC  Wadkins. Wife, Mary, plantation for life. Sons: John, Benjamin, Joseph, Henry & Stephen who gets one cow and other items at age 21. Wife to be Executrix. 15 Nov 1714. Wit: Thos. Edwards, Allen Tye, Robert Woodson Jr. Rec. 7 Feb 1
2 CONC 715.≤/ref> was born about 1695 in Henrico County, Virginia.≤ref name=FG>Find a Grave memorial #[https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/183840735/joseph-watkins 183840735] for Joseph Watkins, created by brenda joyce, Aug. 1, 2008. Mem
2 CONC orial includes a citation of RootsWeb WorldConnect Project: Ferguson-Sauers Family Files and a note seeking sources.≤/ref>
2 CONT Joseph married Mary Farrar, daughter of Thomas Farrar and Katherine Perrin. Their daughter Mary married Henry Willis, Sr.≤ref name=FG />
2 CONT * Mary Isabelle Watkins Willis (1733 - 1800)≤ref name=FG />
2 CONT
2 CONT * Joseph Watkins died in Goochland County about 1738.≤ref name=FG />
2 CONT
2 CONT === Birth ===: 1700, Henrico, Virginia, USA≤ref name=S1>Ancestry Family Trees ([http://trees.ancestry.com/pt/AMTCitationRedir.aspx?tid=22669066&pid=566 Family Tree file]s submitted by Ancestry members).≤/ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT === Death ===
2 CONT : 1734, Goochland, Virginia, USA≤ref name=S1 />
2 CONT
2 CONT === Farrar 1740 Will ===:The will of Joseph's father-in-law Thomas Farrar mentions his granddaughter. Thomas Farrar's will, dated 28 Febuary 1740, was proven 15 June 1742.≤ref name=FG />
2 CONT :: "Item I give and bequeath unto my grand Daughter Mary Watkins one negro boy called Davy to her and her heirs forever"≤ref name=FG />
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT ≤references />
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/183840735/joseph-watkins
