2 CONT Thomas Bottom
2 CONT * Born 1688 in Henrico County, V
2 CONT * Son of John Bottom and Elizabeth (Watkins) Bottom
2 CONT * Brother of John E Bottom, Mary (Bottoms) Garrett, Elizabeth Bottoms, William Bottom and Joseph Bottoms	
2 CONT * Husband of Lydia Marshall ??? (UNKNOWN) Bottom — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT * Father of Jane Bottom, Mary Agnes (Bottom) Stegall, Thomas Bottom, Agnes (Bottom) Stegall and William Bottom
2 CONT * Died 24 Oct 1765 at about age 77 in Amelia County, VA
2 CONT
