2 CONT
2 CONT https://bottomfamilyresearch.blogspot.com/2012/09/thomas-bottom-abt-1686-1765-of-henrico.html
2 CONT
2 CONT (p 560) Deed of Gift.  Thomas Bottom, the Elder of Amelia Co. to '''Mary Magdaline Rives (wife of Frederick Rives)''' of Brunswick Co. VA D. 28 Feb 1762.  Consid:  Affection for '''his granddaughter''', wife of said Frederick Rive
2 CONC s.  One Negro woman slave named Anaky; one Negro girl named Doll, about 5 years old; and one Negro boy named Hampton, about 5 months old.
2 CONT
2 CONT Will 1765 Parish of Raleigh Dau Jane Vaughn gd (granddaughter) '''Frances Worsham''', gd (granddaughter) '''Mary Hubbard''' after mother's death I give son Thomas Sole Executor wp 24 day Oct 1765
2 CONT
2 CONT Will of Thomas Bottom
2 CONT
2 CONT Will Book 2X, pg 125 Amelia County, Virginia
2 CONT Written May 10, 1765
2 CONT Probated Oct 1765
2 CONT
2 CONT This land was on the north side of Proctor's Creek (formerly land of John Clark, deceased) and joined Thomas Branch and Matthew Branch, Henrico Co. VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the name of God Amen the Tenth day of May in the year of Our Lord One Thousand seven hundred and sixty five.
2 CONT
2 CONT I Thomas Bottom of the Parish of Raleigh in the county of Amelia being sick and weak of body but of a sound and perfect memory do make and ordain this my last will and testament. In the first place my will is that all my just debt
2 CONC s be paid.
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM. I lend '''my daughter Jane Vaughn''' during her natural life one negro woman named Bett and all her increase. The said Negros are in her possession.
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM. I give my''' grand daughter Francis Worsham''' one negro girl named Judy with her increase which she is to possess (upon) the death of her mother the which I give to her and her heirs forever;
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM. I give and bequeath '''my son Thomas Bottom''' all the rest of my estate both real and personal to him and her heirs forever;
2 CONT
2 CONT ITEM. I desire my estate may not be appraised - lastly I constitute and appoint my son Thomas Bottom whole and executor of this my Last Will and Testament hereby revoking and disannulling all former wills by me made either by word
2 CONC  of mouth or in writing. Ratifying and confirming this and no other to be my Last Will and Testament.
2 CONT
2 CONT In Witness whereof I have hereunto set my Hand and Seal the day and year fist above written.
2 CONT
