2 CONT '''Thomas, son of John, b. circa 1686 Henrico Co. VA d.1765. Lived in Amelia Co. VA. Again, no marriage info;
2 CONT '''
2 CONT Thomas, son of Thomas, b. circa 1719 Raleigh Parrish, Amelia Co. VA, d. 1781 Amelia Co. VA. Married Lydia Bott, dau of Thomas & Ann (maiden not avail) Bott of Dale Parrish, Chesterfield Co. VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas (Jr), son of Thomas, b. circa 1745 Amelia Co, d.circa 1788 Amelia Co. Married Sarah Oliver, dau of James & Elizabeth (No maiden) Oliver.
2 CONT
2 CONT William, son of Thomas Jr, b.circa 1785 Amelia Co. d. circa 1863 Cherokee Co. TX. I believe he had Indian name Knockatubby but not sure). Marriage bond to Annie (Polly) Witt, dau of Elijah & Nina (Jaragin) Witt.
2 CONT
2 CONT W(William?) Zachariah Bottoms, son of William Bottom, b. 26 Sept 1812 Giles Co. TN, d. 1895 or 96 Garvin Co., Indian Territory. Marriage bond to Elizabeth (Waters) Taylor 25 Dec 1838 in Douglas TX. It is believe Eliz is Cherokee I
2 CONC ndian but found no proof to date.
2 CONT ----
