2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT {{One Name Study|name=Johnson}}John was born in 1766. He was the son of [[Johnson-12006|John Johnson]] and [[Watkins-1193|Lydia Watkins]].  He passed away in 1803. He married Rhoda Moorman and they had the following children:<ref>
2 CONC [https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=mdp.39015051447657&view=1up&seq=330 Encyclopedia of American Quaker genealogy Vol 6] ''Page: 318.''</ref>
