2 CONT #John Johnson, 1795-1846
2 CONT #Charles Johnson, 1797-
2 CONT #Polly "Mary" Moorman Johnson, 1799-
2 CONT #Lewis Johnson, 1801-1821
2 CONT #James Johnson, 1803-1860
