2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/71530742/judith_evaline_watkins
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith Evaline Watkins married John E. Watkins on 16 April 1812 at the home of Mary Watkins by the Rev.Reubin Ford. Judith and John had 11 children: Joseph Mayo, Mary Ann Henningham, Cordelia Ellen, Mildred Emma, Henry Carrington,
2 CONC  Robert Bruce, Virginia Wilhelmina, Indiana Elizabeth, Louisa Nevison, John Quarles, and Ella Cabel Watkins. All children's names taken from Judith's family bible.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ampthill Burial Grounds: Ampthill Plantation, Chesterfield County, Virginia (now on DuPont's "Spruance" Plant, a secure site, 5401 Jefferson Davis Highway, Richmond, Virginia 23234)
2 CONT
2 CONT Grave Inscription
2 CONT
2 CONT IN MEMORY OF JUDITH WATKINS, WIFE OF JOHN WATKINS, OF AMPTHILL, BORN APR 2, 1794 - DIED NOV. 30, 1872. AT REST WITH CHRIST
