2 CONT She married William Daniel in Cumberland County about 28 March 1767, date of bond. [2] They were the parents of seven children. These children were: Martha Coleman, Elizabeth Coleman, Mary Woodson, Obedience Thompson, Frances Tall
2 CONC ey, Lucy Miller, and William Daniel Jr. 
