1 NAME Elizabeth /Watkins/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Watkins
2 _MARNM Harris
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 JUN 1778
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Elizabeth Watkins married Obadiah Harris it reunited the two lines of the family of Captain Thomas Harriswho was amongst the first settlers of Virginia, having arrived in 1610/1611 old style.  Elizabeth Watkin
2 CONC s was descended from the daughter of Thos. Harris, Mary Harris who married Thomas Ligon/Lygon.  Through the Ligon famiy the heritage passes down through the Hancock family and onto the Watkins family.  (Elizabeth Watkins was the d
2 CONC tr. of Silas Watkins and Phebe Watkins, they were both descended from Henry Watkins, the Welsh Quaker.)  Obadiah Harris was descended from Thos HArris through his son. Maj. William  Harris.   Capt.Thomas, Major William, William, D
2 CONC avid, Giles, Obadiah, Ammon, Josephine Harris Erwin, Margaret Erwin Dilley, Mildred Dilley Schultze, and me.
2 CONT
2 CONT Corrected 9/22/2016
