1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Ligon''' was born in 1695 in Henrico, Henrico, VA, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-21124844 James Anderson, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-73538195 Elizabeth Anderson]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-12103875 Matthew Ligon] in 1710 in Powhatan, Virginia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-12103852 Richard Ligon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21124802 James Ligon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21124803 Mathew Ligon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21124808 Frances Ligon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-37040362 Thomas Ligon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21124805 Elizabeth Ligon]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-21124807 William Ligon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1740 in Goochland, Goochland, VA, United States. 
