1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth LIGON and James ANDERSON are:1.
2 CONT
2 CONT *  i. Charles ANDERSON was born ABT 1730 in , Amelia, Virginia, and died 1821 in , Mason, Kentucky. He married Lucy STOKES 1768 in Virginia, daughter of Young STOKES and Elizabeth, Wife of Young STOKES. She was born BEF 1746 in Of
2 CONC , , Lunenburg, Virginia, and died BEF 1810 in , Mason, Kentucky.
2 CONT * ii. Mary ANDERSON was born ABT 1732, and died AFT 1773. She married George MARTIN. He died AFT 1773.
2 CONT * iii. John ANDERSON was born 4 May 1734 in , Prince George, Virginia, and died 1794 in , Nottoway, Virginia. He married Martha, Wife of John ANDERSON. She died BEF 1794.
2 CONT * iv. Mason ANDERSON was born ABT 1736 in , Amelia, Virginia, and died AFT 1773. She married Peter KNIGHT. He died in , Nottoway, Virginia.
2 CONT * v. James ANDERSON was born ABT 1739 in , Prince George, Virginia, and died 1782 in , Amelia, Virginia. He married Elizabeth JENNINGS BEF 1766. She was born BEF 1745, and died AFT 1793.
2 CONT * vi. Henry ANDERSON was born 1740 in , Amelia, Virginia, and died 1796 in , Nottoway, Virginia. He married ?. He married Ann, Wife of Henry ANDERSON. He married Lucy RICHARDSON.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
