1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Mary Tanner and William Ligon, birth dates estimated, born at Henrico County, were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  '''Mary3 Ligon''' born about 1677. Mentioned in her father William Ligon’s will dated 21 January 1688/9. Mentioned in her grandmother Mary Platt’s will dated 10 March 1699/1700. m. 1st, William Anderson. A license was granted 
2 CONC them July 15, 1698, Henrico Co.a She m. 2nd, Peter Rowlett. Court at Varina January 1716/17 : Statement that Wm. Ligon, deed, left certain land to be divided between his daughter Mary (now married to Peter Rowlett) & an unborn chi
2 CONC ld, now 21 years old, & named Lucretia. b
2 CONT
2 CONT >''Sources: Ligon, William D. (William Daniel). “The Ligon family and connections. Volume l” (1947).  Page 326.  < [https://archive.org/details/ligonfamilyconne01ligo/page/326/mode/1up Archive.Org] > (No birth dates listed for the
2 CONC  children.) & https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ligon-77 & Dorman, John Frederick (2004).  Chapter "Thomas Harris", in Adventurers of Purse and Person, Virginia, 1607-1624/5: Families G-P. Genealogical Press, p. 268. < [https://books.
2 CONC google.com/books?id=tcM40zgdAZgC&lpg=PA268&pg=PA268#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] >
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.  William4 Anderson (Reynard3, "South Side"2, "Colonial Virginia"1)1 was born Bet. 1670 - 1675 in Charles City County, Virginia1, and died Aft. 1727 in Prince Georges County, Virginia1.  He married Mary Ligon1 July 15, 1698 in H
2 CONC enrico County, Virginia1, daughter of William Ligon and Mary Tanner.  She was born 1679 in Henrico County, Virginia1, and died Aft. 1727 in Prince George County, Virginia1.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Comments 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Ligon family claims that he died before 1716 and that his wife remarried to Peter Rowlett. However they are depending upon a deed abstract that has errors in it. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # http://homepages.rootsweb.com/~anderson/va/trees/reynard.html 
2 CONT # https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ligon-169
