1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Abraham Cocke''' (son of Stephen Cocke) married Mary Batte 1729 in Charles City, VA. She was the daughter of 6. William Batte and 7. Mary Stratton. 10 children. See page 8 of "Cockes and Cousins" 1967
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Abraham Cocke and Mary Batte are:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  i.               Abraham Cocke, born September 30, 1730 in Charles City, VA; died December 27, 1782. More About Abraham Cocke: Residence: Removed to Alabama
2 CONT *                           ii.               Peter Cocke, born 1732 in Amelia, VA; died 1780.
2 CONT *                          iii.               Mary Cocke, born ABT  1736; married William Ellis; born Unknown.
2 CONT *                          iv.               Agnes Cocke, born 1737 in Amelia, VA; died 1800; married Charles Hamlin 1757; born in Prince George.
2 CONT *                           v.               Stephen Cocke, born March 31, 1740 in Amelia, Va; died January 1793 in Nottoway, VA; married Amy Jones December 4, 1764 in Amelia, VA; born January 26, 1746/47 in Amelia, Virginia; died
2 CONC  June 1, 1824 in Washington, Ky. More About Stephen Cocke:    Occupation: Bet. 1775 - 1800, Sheriff of Amelia Co., Virginia
2 CONT *                          vi.               Elizabeth Cocke, born ABT  1741; died October 1, 1815; married John Cross 1765; born Unknown.
2 CONT *                         vii.               John Cocke, born ABT  1741.
2 CONT *                        viii.               Martha Cocke, born ABT  1742 in Amelia, VA; died ABT  1777; married Theophilus Lacy 1760; born Unknown.
2 CONT *                           ix.               Thomas Cocke, born ABT  1746 in Amelia, VA; died 1839. More About Thomas Cocke:    Residence: Removed to Tennessee
2 CONT *          1                 x.               William Cocke, born September 6, 1747 in Amelia, VA; died August 22, 1828 in Columbus, Mississippi; married Mary MacLin March 24, 1772 in Brunswick County, VA.
2 CONT
