2 CONT "Claiborne of Virginia" by John Frederick Dorman, 1995, p. 228-229
2 CONT MARRIAGE: Willson paper by Sallie JACKSON Stokes (from Judy S. Barnes), p. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT See family of Thomas Branch Willson (#440)
2 CONT See family of Francis Anderson (#442)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann "Nancy" Anderson was born 27 Dec 1777, the daughter of Francis Anderson and Edith WALDEN Anderson of Amelia Co., VA.  Ann had a sister Elizabeth Anderson who married Daniel Willson (son of Thomas Branch Willson and his first w
2 CONC ife, Elizabeth Finnie).
2 CONT On 15 Aug 1796, in Amelia Co., VA, Ann "Nancy" Anderson married Thomas Friend Willson (see # 440b-1; son of Thomas Branch Willson and his second wife, Judith Friend).  Ann was 19 and her husband 21 years old, at the time of their 
2 CONC marriage.  They had 15 children.
2 CONT Ann "Nancy" ANDERSON Willson died in Amelia Co., VA in 1825, at the age of 48.  Her husband died in Amelia in 1841, at the age of 66.
