1 NOTE In the 1860 census, she was listed as "Martha". On her marriage license, she used Anna M. On her death certificate and gravestone, it is Annie. And in the family, to quote Cousin Lena Watkins Grantham, she was called "Nannie". It 
2 CONC appears that her mother died at her birth. Her obituary states that she had six great grandchildren and that she moved to Sanford in 1906. She lived at 406 Carthage Street. She is buried in Buffalo Cemetery, Sanford as are most of
2 CONC  her children.
