2 CONT 1860 AR census - Calf Creek George Turney listed with second wife Mary and two children from their first marriages, "Melly" and James, both 12.  Four children from this marriage, Pleasant 7, George 5, John 3 and Mary 3.5 (must be 
2 CONC months, as she was born in 1860).
2 CONT
2 CONT Enlisted 5 Aug 1861 at Yellville as a Private, Co. K, 14th (Powers) Ark. Inf. and deserted 6 April 1862.  (While listed as deserted, supposed to have been fighting Yankees around the Searcy area). Also served Co. G, Jackman's MO C
2 CONC AV (CSA); enlisted Searcy Co., age 44.  Paroled 5 June 1865 at Jacksonport, AR.
2 CONT
