1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT Dollyie Martin in Alabama from Joseph Turney s/o Henry (d 1843 Tn).....she is a profession researcher and does it for a living called me this week with news of proof of the maiden name of Joseph Turneys wife.  I don't know if you 
2 CONC do anything with the Alabama Turneys - but the wife of Joseph Turney born 1787 and brother to our Peter......was Nancy Little born 22 May 1796 NC or TN, died 4 May 1852 Morgan Co Alabama and buried in Turney cemetery in Morgan Co 
2 CONC Alabama.....Vol 1 page 187 Morgan Co Alabama cemetery records....location T-8SR3WS12.  So I have been looking at Little/Lytle family and finding them in Jackson Co TN......and doing business with the Peter Turney who died 1804 Dix
2 CONC on Springs TN.....I just never noticed them before.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name was provided on the Death Certificate of Elisha Dotson Turney.
2 CONT Source Link: https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000175883078823label=@S93@
