2 CONT
2 CONT COMPANY C, 10TH ARKANSAS INFANTRY REGIMENT 
2 CONT CONFEDERATE STATES OF AMERICA 
2 CONT
2 CONT TURNEY, JOSEPH Pvt Captured 8 Dec 1864 in Lafayette Co, MO and sent to MP at St Louis, MO then to Point Lookout, MD 27 Feb 1864. Released 19 Jul 1865. Ht 5' 6", eyes hazel, hair lt, complx fair, residence, Van Buren Co, AR.
2 CONT
2 CONT In his statement when he was captured he says "My age is 47 years, I live in Van Buren Co., AR.  I was born Smith co., TN."  Other military records on him say he had a wife and 5 children.  This would be before 1865, so guess a ch
2 CONC ild was born during the war - and it might be John Wesley, born 1864. Source Link: https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000175883078848label=@S482@
