2 CONT Posted by Mary Turney Miller on Sat, 13 Nov 1999
2 CONT "Elizabeth Turney born 1820 Smith County Tennessee, daughter of Peter Turney and Hannah. First husband was John Bailey - think they married in TN, entire family ca 1834 to Arkansas, in 1835 tax records. 1840 census Peter Turney an
2 CONC d John Bailey are still alive. Peter Turney died after census 1840, before tax in 1842. 1850 census VBC Elizabeth Bailey as a widow is living with her mother Hannah, and her 3 Bailey children. Sometime after that married to Willia
2 CONC m Gadberry - wish I knew if they had any children......" Source Link: https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000175882890856label=@S305@
