1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Corrections suggested by Ronald Tucker (March 30, 2015):
2 CONT
2 CONT George R. Tucker Sr and Jemima Malone Tucker are my 6th great grandparents. It looks as though there is some confusion about a marriage between George R Tucker Sr and Unknown which results in the known children of George and Jemim
2 CONC a to have half brothers with the same names as their known siblings: 
2 CONT *1. Correct- George Jr. b. 1/2/1743 and Incorrect- George Jr. b. 1765) 
2 CONT *2. Correct- William b.1751 and William George- b. 1773 
2 CONT
2 CONT I have not been able to find any evidence that George Sr. had children with anyone other than Jemima Malone. 
