2 CONT - Francis EPPERSON b: 1756 in Albemarle Co., Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT - Thompson EPPERSON b: 1757 in 20 miles S.W. of Charlottesville, Albemarle Co., VA (Epperson Mt.)
2 CONT
2 CONT - John EPPERSON b: 1761 in Albemarle Co., VA (my 4th Gr. Grandfather)
