1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Abraham Michaux''' was born in 1608 in Sedan, Champagne-Ardenne, France. He was a Married in 1643. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham married [https://www.geni.com/profile-80248361 Marie Michaux] in 1643 in Sedan, Ardennes, Champagne-Ardenne, France. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-94673797 Jacques Jacob Michaux]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1667 in Sedan, Champagne-Ardenne, France. 
