1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Marie Michaux''' was born in 1610 in Sedan, Ardennes, Champagne-Ardenne, France. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-11294147 Jacob Godon] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-11295854 Marie Godon]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie married [https://www.geni.com/profile-127240489 Abraham Michaux] in 1643 in Sedan, Ardennes, Champagne-Ardenne, France. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-94673797 Jacques Jacob Michaux].
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on September 24, 1672, in Sedan, Ardennes, Champagne-Ardenne, France. 
2 CONT ----
