1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Judith Ann Fitch''' was born on March 17, 1759 in Prince Edward County, Virginia, USA. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-17346136 Alexander Le Grande] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-59993400 Lucy LeGrand]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith married [https://www.geni.com/profile-35568189 Charles A. Fitch]. No Issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1783 in Appomattox, Appomattox County, Virginia, USA, Campbell, VA, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Charles left his estate to his wife and the following: children of Samuel Fitch, Elizabeth Burks, Frances Spears, niece Elizabeth Sorrells (daughter of Frances Spears) and nephews Charles Burks and Charles Fitch. He apparently had
2 CONC  no children of his own.
2 CONT '''
2 CONT She wasn't married to a  Alexander LeGrande, Jr - only to Charles A Fitch. 
