1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===George Walker Cunningham
2 CONT *Gender: Male
2 CONT *Birth: July 15 1807   North Carolina, United States
2 CONT *Marriage: Spouse: Susan Turner Rieves Feb 27 1839  Warren, North Carolina, United States
2 CONT *Residence: 1870   North Carolina, United States
2 CONT *Death: June 1872  Granville, North Carolina, United States
2 CONT *Wife: Susan Turner Cunningham (born Rieves) Children:
2 CONT * Susan Alice Harris (born Cunningham)
2 CONT * Celestia Frances Grissom (born Cunningham)
2 CONT * Mary Esther Cunningham
2 CONT * Indiana V. Cunningham
2 CONT * William Alexander Cunningham
2 CONT * Rosanne Jane Turner (born Cunningham)
2 CONT * Stephen Rieves Cunningham
2 CONT * George Albert Cunningham
2 CONT * Josiah H Cunningham
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT George W. Cunningham was born about 1805 in Virginia. He married Susan Rieves on 27 Feb. 1839 at Warren County, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a farmer when he and Susan appeared on the census of 1 Oct. 1850 at Louisburg, Franklin County, North Carolina. He was a farmer when he and Susan appeared on the census of 2 Aug. 1860 at Epping Forest, Granville County, Nor
2 CONC th Carolina. He was a farmer when he and Susan appeared on the census of 15 Aug. 1870 at Kitrells Township, Granville County, North Carolina.
2 CONT
2 CONT George died before the 18 July 1872, the date of probate distribution, in Granville County, North Carolina. Susan Cunningham, his widow, Mary E., William A., Indiana V., Roxania J. Turner, Stephen N., Celestea A., George A. and Su
2 CONC san A. Cunningham were identified as entitled as heirs and distributees in his probate.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Residence''': 1850 - Franklin county, Franklin, North Carolina, USA
2 CONT ** Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-10126-16031282-/george-cunningham-in-1850-united-states-federal-census?indId=externalindividual-bdf54ec8f56f42da9282b9937390dc55&mrid=6e1a8cb1b4b49bba381cbe03c22f8a6b 1850 
2 CONC United States Federal Census] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 15 2019, 7:37:56 UTC''
2 CONT *https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/4:1:LCZT-KFL
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Cunningham-9583 WikiTree Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 15 2019, 7:42:56 UTC''
