1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Title: LDS - James S Beck & John Kent Cabaniss Publication: ? 1987, June 1998, data as of 5 January 1998 Title: Joseph Carter Title: Carter-Neal Bible At the Halifax County. Virginia, coui't, held in  November, 179
2 CONC 9, the following was ordered and made  of record : 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Theodrick Carter. Gentleman, is recommended  to his Excellency, the Governor or Chief Magistrate,  for the time being, as a fit person to execute the office  of Sheriff of this County for the ensuing year." 
