1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The daughter of Elizabeth Morgan and John Oliver Minter, Judith Minter married Abraham Womack, reportedly in 1770 in Chatham Co., NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her exact death date is unproven, but she passed away before May 1825.  
2 CONT Her widower, Abraham Womack married 2nd Miss Lucy Moody 8 May 1825 in Jones Co., GA.
