1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  David Cock * MyHeritage Family Trees Bearer Family Website, managed by Bruce Bearer (Contact) Birth:	1697 - Cocks Island, Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, United States Death:	Apr 10 1765 - Frederick, Washington, Maryl
2 CONC and, United States Parents:	Gabriel Petersson Cock *, Anna Maria Nilsdotter Cock * (born Frande *) Siblings:	Peter Cock, Gabriel "gabe" Cock, Rebecca Cock, Margart Cock, Annicka Cock, Isaac Cock, Ephraim Cock Wife:	Susannah Cock *
2 CONC  (born Davis) Children:	Mary Cox, Joseph Cox, Letitia Shelby (born Cox *), Ezekial Cox, Sarah Cox, Mary Cox, Joseph Cock, Mary Cock (Cox), Mary Cox
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/lewis/8009/
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Davis (called The Black Davis)who married Abadiah Lewis who was his first wife and had children: Susannah who married David Cox; Martha (sometimes seen as Hannah) married Abraham B. Venable- some books have Martha as the da
2 CONC ughter of Nathaniel Davis and Elizabeth Hughes); Isham(Isom); James married Jane Black; Robert married Jane Jopling; John; Abadiah (Abby) married William Floyd (some books have Abadiah as daughter of Nathaniel Davis and Elizabeth 
2 CONC Hughes); Elizabeth married Unknown Sexton; Nathaniel married Elizabeth Atkins (who is the sister of his stepmother Anna Atkins); Evan married Mary E. Williams.
2 CONT
2 CONT Second wife was Anna Atkins - they had a son Absolom - she may have died in childbirth or shortly thereafter.
2 CONT
2 CONT His third wife was Grace Unknown - they had children Lewis, Landon, and Hugh.
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Davis died in Natchez, Georgia which is now Mississippi.I have his will in my notes
