2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1800 [113]; 
2 CONT ***d. Aft. 1830.
2 CONT ****Notes for WYATT PRESTON TULEY: There is extensive information on this man's descendants in the Tuley book noted op. cit. 
2 CONT *6.  	vi.	 	MARY TULEY, 
