2 CONT 17. MAJOR ROBERT CLARK5 FLOYD (WILLIAM4, JOHN3, CHARLES2, JOHN1) [144],[145] 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1752 in Albemarle or Amherst Co., VA [146],[147],[148], and 
2 CONT *died Bef. 07 March 1807 in Jefferson Co., KY ? [149]. 
2 CONT *He married LILLIAN PARKER [149],[150] Bef. 1779 [151], 
