2 CONT
2 CONT And Alex sends this in Nov., 2002: "I have more circumstantial evidence for PARKER being the last name of Robert's wife. 
2 CONT *"1) There is a letter at the Filson Club in the Floyd family file from from the 1930's from a MOODY of Jeffersontown, enquiring about a Robert Floyd deed. The Moodys married into the family of Haley Buckner and Lillian Parker, da
2 CONC ughter of Samuel Parker. 
2 CONT *"2) Philip Johnston, who is a son of William Johnston and Ann Chew or his second wife Elizabeth Taylor, married a Margaret Elizabeth Parker. I believe Philip Johnston settled in Shelby Co., KY which is near Jeffersontown. Haley B
2 CONC uckner also settled in Shelby Co. This is all near the Floyds Fork area. 
2 CONT
2 CONT "I'll just keep stirring until something pops up to the surface... " 
