2 CONT 18. JEMIMA5 FLOYD (WILLIAM4, JOHN3, CHARLES2, JOHN1)[157],[158] 
2 CONT *was born 1753 in Amherst Co., VA [159]. 
2 CONT *She married (1) JOHN LEMASTER [160],[161] 1768 in Amherst Co., VA or Henry Co., KY [162]. 
2 CONT **He was born 1749 in Amherst Co., VA [163], and 
2 CONT **died 16 September 1781 in Floyd's defeat by Indians, near present day Eastwood, KY [164]. 
2 CONT *She married (2) JAMES A. STURGIS [165] 28 May 1784 in Jefferson Co., KY [166],[167], 
2 CONT **son of JAMES A STURGIS and MARGARET. He was born Abt. 1756, and 
2 CONT **died Aft. 1810168. 
