2 CONT ****"She was some thirteen years older than her husband, Joseph King, and she was very anxious to keep the fact a secret. Consequently she informed the census taker in 1850 that she was born in 1803; in 1860 she told him it was 18
2 CONC 05; but by the time 1870 rolled around, she had lowered the date to 1800. Actually the bible says she entered this world on March 30, 1797." Adding to the confusion, Anna elsewhere reports her birth as 20 March 1798. 
