2 CONT *1. 59.	i.	 	MAJOR THOMAS FLOYD6 SMITH, 
2 CONT **b. 1784, Jefferson Co., KY; 
2 CONT **d. December 1843, or near St. Louis, MO.
2 CONT *2. 60.	ii.	 	MARY FLOYD SMITH, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1786, Bear Grass Creek, Jefferson Co., KY; 
2 CONT **d. 1872, IL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ABIGAIL FLOYD and JAMES ALEXANDER are: 
2 CONT *1. 	iii.	 	SYDNEY S.6 ALEXANDER, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1794 [237]; 
2 CONT **m. FATURA W. OLDHAM [237], 29 March 1831, Jefferson Co., KY; 
2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1818, KY.
2 CONT *2.  	iv.	 	FREDERICK GRAYSON ALEXANDER, 
2 CONT **b. Abt. 1796 [237]; 
2 CONT **d. 1833, Bullitt Co., KY; 
2 CONT **m. MARY LOUISA ANDERSON, 12 February 1832, Jefferson Co., KY; 
2 CONT ***b. Abt. 1798.
