1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''George Cabell,''' son of William Cabell, MD., and wife Elizabeth Burks, was born in Virginia and died while still a child. Sources vary on his dates, but it believed that he was their last child, which puts his 
2 CONC birth between 1750 and 1756 (birth of next youngest child and death of his mother).
2 CONT
2 CONT See also -
