1 NAME Susannah /Smith/
2 GIVN Susannah
2 SURN Smith
2 _MARNM Lilly
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 APR 1746
2 PLAC St. James Northam Parish
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
1 DEAT
2 DATE BET 1792 AND 1810
2 ADDR
3 STAE Kentucky
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Susanna Smith'''  was the daughter of Mary Burks and Obadiah Smith. She was born April 28, 1746 in St. James Northam Parish, Goochland County, Virginia. She is believed to have died in Bourbon County, Kentucky a
2 CONC fter 1792 and before 1810. 
2 CONT
2 CONT It is my belief that Susannah married Thomas Lilly, although several web trees show her married to Isaac Winston. Isaac actually married her sister Elizabeth. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas Lilly''' was born c.1737 in Virginia and died in Bourbon County, Kentucky after December 1, 1810. His father may have been Edmund Lilly. He may have been the brother of Armiger and William Lilly. He is found in Fluvanna 
2 CONC County, Virginia in 1786 through 1790, on various tax registers. It is soon after 1790 that the family moves to Kentucky. He wrote his will on December 1, 1810, and died soon after.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bourbon County, Kentucky, is the remnant of what was previously a much larger Bourbon County, established as part of Virginia in 1785 and comprising what are now thirty-four modern Kentucky counties. The area later became known as
2 CONC  Old Bourbon in reference to its historical expanse. It was originally part of the French province of Louisiana, then after 1763 became part of Virginia, but was transferred to the newly formed Commonwealth of Kentucky in 1792.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Susannah Smith and husband Thomas Lilly:
2 CONT * Edmund Lilly, born 10/28/1760 in Virginia
2 CONT * Ann Lilly, born 11/21/64 in Virginia, married Anthony Gohagen in 1792 in Bourbon County, Kentucky
2 CONT * Joshua Lilly, born 2/17/1767 in Virginia and is believed to have died before 1820. Married Keziah Morgan in 1797 in Bourbon County, Kentucky.
2 CONT * Robert Lilly, born 9/7/1769 in Virginia
2 CONT * Thomas Lilly
2 CONT * Susanna Lilly
2 CONT * Lucy Lilly
2 CONT * Elizabeth Lilly
2 CONT * Mary Lilly
2 CONT * Sarah Lilly
2 CONT
2 CONT For more on the Lilly family please see http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~cullember/otherfam/thomasky.html
