1 NAME Benjamin A /Huddleston/
2 GIVN Benjamin A
2 SURN Huddleston
2 _MARNM Huddleston
2 NICK Uncle Ben Huddleston
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 FEB 1817
2 ADDR
3 STAE Tennessee
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE FEB 1904
2 PLAC Oregon County, Missouri, USA
2 ADDR
3 CITY Thomasville
3 STAE Missouri
