1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Dr Isaac Carrington Harrison'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/95557578/isaac_carrington_harrison
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac studied at Richmond College (Univ. of Richmond) & the Univ. of Virginia for medicine. He passed the exam in 1895. He then taught chemistry at UVA in 1896-1897. Rosalie and he were married 1/24/1899. Isaac started his medical
2 CONC  practice in Clarksville, Virginia but moved that practice to Danville. He was a member of the Virginia Board of Medical Examiners.
