1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hettie Shields Jarnagin was an American librarian.  
2 CONT
2 CONT She graduated from Vassar College (year unknown) and later the Pratt Institute Library School (1907).  
2 CONT
2 CONT Hettie joined the American Library Association in 1899, receiving member number 1866.  She served as library of the University of Tennessee at Knoxville in 1901.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in Pittsburg (Pennsylvania?) on January 16, 1908 of pneumonia.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * "[http://books.google.com/books?id=YLBJAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA125&lpg=PA125 1908 Bulletin]," American Library Association, p. 125.
