2 CONT
2 CONT Aged 78 Years
2 CONT
2 CONT The Virginian Pilot February 16, 1961
2 CONT
2 CONT John Read Walker, 76, former Norfolk resident, died Wednesday in his home in Washington. Mr. Walker, an attorney, was a native of Kansas City, Mo. And a son of Mr. and John Mrs. Walker. He is survived by his widow, Mrs. Virginia M
2 CONC cBlair Walker of Washington; one son, Col. Anthony Walker, USMC, of Camp Pendleton, Calif.; two brothers Brevard Walker of Florida and Ewing Walker of Hattiesburg, Miss.; and three grandchildren.  The body will be taken from the H
2 CONC .D. Oliver Funeral Apartments to Cedar Grove Cemetery for a graveside funeral service Friday at 11:30 a.m. by the Rev. Beverley W. Tucker, rector of Old Donation Episcopal Church.
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/84944977/john-read-walker Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 3 2021, 16:00:10 UTC''
