0 @N6000000003412783151@ NOTE
1 CONT Mary Barbour m. John Harrison, they had one daughter, who married a Mason, and their son, James Barbour Mason, at one time represented Garrard Co. in the Kentucky Legislature. He married a daughter of Hugh Logan, and their son, Ja
1 CONC mes B. Mason, was Clerk of Garrard Co., Ky., and now (1899) lives in Lancaster, Ky. Source:
1 CONT David E. Wisdom; EMail: WKPT13C@prodigy.com & Dwisdom@prodigy.net 11/98; 
