1 CONT "Log Cabins to the White House" (Taylor Lineage) "From Sea to Shinning Sea" by Thom, describes this family during the revolution. One of the sons died in a British Prison Ship in New York harbor. 
1 CONT David Wisdom descends from two Taylor lines, the immigrant James Taylor and from Rev. War Col. Geo. Taylor. The data supplied here is from records in the La Grange KY newspaper files and court house records, along with the Centenn
1 CONC ial Celebration doucments of La Grange, KY.
